    <node id="DRIVE TO SURVIVE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">"Drive to Survive" is a popular Netflix documentary series that offers an inside look at the world of Formula 1 racing. The series chronicles the Formula 1 racing season, showcasing the drama and excitement of the sport, which has significantly contributed to its popularity among viewers and fans alike. It has captivated audiences and enhanced their engagement with Formula 1, influencing many individuals, including Anthony, Isabelle, Owen, Yusup Malang, Cleo, and others, to develop a deeper interest in the sport. The series has been binge-watched by various viewers seeking to understand Formula 1 better, further solidifying its impact on the sport's fanbase. Overall, "Drive to Survive" has played a crucial role in popularizing Formula 1, making it more accessible and appealing to a broader audience.</data>
