    <node id="TRAVELLING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Travelling is a cherished and significant activity for the author and their family, often undertaken during holidays. This activity involves exploring various countries, which not only serves as a means of bonding but also broadens their knowledge and experiences. The family engages in these trips as a way to create lasting memories and enjoy quality time together, emphasizing the importance of family connections.

Travelling is not just a family tradition; it is also a favored hobby of the author, who has enjoyed it from a young age. This passion for exploration and adventure reflects a desire to experience new cultures and environments. The author finds travelling to be a source of joy and relaxation, often viewing it as a reward for academic efforts. The trips, particularly those overseas, contribute significantly to the family's leisure time and personal growth, providing enriching experiences that enhance their understanding of the world.

Overall, travelling is a beloved activity that encapsulates the family's commitment to exploration, cultural appreciation, and the creation of shared experiences, making it an integral part of their lives.</data>
