    <node id="COFFEE CHERRIES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Coffee cherries are the fruit harvested from coffee trees, representing the initial stage in the coffee-making process. They are crucial and essential for producing coffee beans, which are derived from these cherries. The cherries are raw fruits that undergo processing to yield the coffee beans used in brewing coffee. Overall, coffee cherries play a vital role in the journey from plant to cup, serving as the foundational element in the production of coffee.</data>
      <data key="d2">048269ae298e29136a527a89c01376b0,0d3e3e61d90a8bed3435a6540fa21b4c,13d9abba81dabab2e89912b329a9f60f,18aa5f53d5c15fdf3af8391842abee2e,1acbb397f1146749d1bfa0edd0a42d85,1ff4a40a7f2242cef2196d9d55713d5b,21ff0556160a2e1a97bf334864bfe48a,2645f9ab21364aa932142feca2c9d1e8,2eefc4addb9ebc67f89377ba591aafe0,356542fce3b8397d5446d0a5bc8ec08e,4609b58b90d9e40a897d599b608a7ad3,4839900ee624ba75c86230d9f423e116,4fb3c41f56fd66162b1c74503e385502,6357f12da8d5938caf30b3cdff8e463d,77606d20e1fa15ee358e3e58c8985b84,811b0eb836d0a3a17e2fca476fd0c3c7,89ac925dcc2d82af780dd8bebc5c3080,8b7fb3131130f63105150ae0a5f1f857,8d344a295b535b9bcb584606e38797c9,951d23310233db95fb2aad029b63c871,9d5e1f40c5490449d7f390851af81b72,a293a1339db2894414f622657795d2a5,a4773eb9274a1facd80d87439cd0c054,aa6fb60205a134977c5b3505452e2ab9,aadd1b6fa329903f44920f47f56ac541,ab28db58e2038f0ddc57e4f7f77fbaaa,b3b716c93c99eccad0936db11d4947af,c94746495699743307fe62f8944208bb,ceaf9283c39ab982f4c92afcdab6009f,d0ef13d5282d5331da5ac781d0b6925d,d15244c1f12560a6e73f864478457754,d6833e848bfc8d176402ca3b5f19f878,df1142ef01391002e59cd0ee0c586953,e6442abb66a00b575ae8c4e9a3ab856d,eb4e14fa60a2acdfa3843f16bd555b00,eb88fd11b76d2df23794f6b92e75b492</data>
