    <node id="OSIS KOSAYU">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">OSIS Kosayu is a student organization at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup, dedicated to organizing events and activities for the school community. This organization plays a significant role in the celebration of Independence Day in Indonesia, where it is responsible for coordinating various games and competitions aimed at fostering excitement and engagement among students. Throughout the Independence Day celebrations, OSIS Kosayu has successfully organized a range of activities that contribute to the festive atmosphere, often referred to as the "17an" celebrations. The organization not only focuses on the logistics of these events but also emphasizes the importance of participation and school spirit during this national holiday. Overall, OSIS Kosayu serves as a vital organizing body within SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup, ensuring that students have memorable experiences during significant school events, particularly the Independence Day celebration.</data>
