    <node id="FASHION SHOW">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Fashion Show was a themed event organized as part of the Independence Day celebration at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup. This event involved significant student participation, where students showcased costumes designed from recycled materials, with a specific focus on Indonesian cuisine, particularly the dish Rendang. The show celebrated Indonesian culinary heritage and emphasized creativity and teamwork among the participants.

Throughout the event, students took on various roles, contributing to the design and presentation of costumes that highlighted the theme of Indonesian cuisine. The costumes were crafted from recycled materials, aligning with a broader environmental consciousness while honoring traditional culinary elements. The Fashion Show served not only as a platform for artistic expression but also as a means to celebrate cultural identity and sustainability, making it a memorable highlight of the Independence Day festivities.</data>
