    <node id="INDONESIAN INDEPENDENCE DAY CELEBRATION">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The Indonesian Independence Day Celebration is an annual event held on August 17th to commemorate Indonesia's independence. This significant occasion features a variety of activities and ceremonies that include flag ceremonies, games, and competitions. Celebrated across schools and communities, the event brings people together to honor the nation's history and achievements. The festivities are marked by a spirit of patriotism and unity, showcasing Indonesia's cultural heritage through various engaging activities. Overall, the Indonesian Independence Day Celebration serves as a vibrant reminder of the country's journey to independence and is celebrated with enthusiasm and pride each year.</data>
