    <node id="CREME">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Creme is a newly established cafe located near a school, specifically by the school's parking lot. It has gained popularity for its viral cookies, particularly its large chocolate chip cookies. These cookies are renowned for their incredible taste and unique texture, characterized by a crispy exterior and a gooey interior. They are perfectly sweetened and enhanced with a sprinkle of salt, which adds a savory kick to their flavor profile. The cafe caters to students, providing a delightful treat after school activities, and has become a favorite spot for those seeking delicious snacks. Overall, Creme is celebrated for its large, sweet, and incredibly tasty chocolate chip cookies that have captured the attention of the local student community.</data>
