    <node id="COOKIES">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Cookies are a beloved snack among students, particularly at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup Malang, where they are frequently enjoyed during breaks, meetings, and after school activities. These treats are especially popular from the cafe Creme, known for their large size, perfect sweetness, and unique texture. Students often indulge in these cookies as a guilty pleasure after long study hours or a tiring day at school. 

The cookies from Creme have gained a reputation for their incredible taste, described as crispy on the outside and gooey on the inside, making them a favorite choice for many. They are also available at other local cafes, contributing to their popularity among students in Indonesia. Overall, cookies are a staple snack that enhances the school experience, enjoyed for their convenience and delightful flavor.</data>
