    <node id="CONGEE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Congee is a warm and comforting rice porridge dish that is particularly favored by students, especially at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup Malang and Brokenside Cafe. It is often consumed for comfort and warmth after long days or when feeling unwell. This traditional dish is popular in Chinese cuisine and can be served with a variety of toppings, including century egg, youtiao (fried dough), pickles, and spring onions, enhancing its appeal as a nourishing meal.

Students frequently enjoy congee during school activities, breaks, or when they seek comfort food, making it a staple part of their school experience. The dish is appreciated not only for its soothing qualities but also for its versatility, as it can be customized with different toppings to suit individual preferences. Congee serves as a favorite snack among students, providing warmth and comfort, particularly when they feel cold or have sore throats. Overall, congee is a beloved dish that embodies comfort and nourishment for many students.</data>
