    <node id="LATTE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "LATTE" is a popular coffee beverage that is particularly favored among students, often consumed while studying or working on assignments. It is characterized by its mild flavor, which is achieved through a high milk composition and moderate sweetness from added sugar. This comforting drink is typically made with espresso and steamed milk, making it a go-to choice for many individuals seeking a soothing option during their academic tasks.

Served at Brokenside Cafe, the latte is not only enjoyed for its taste but also serves as a source of comfort and energy for students during their study sessions. It is frequently ordered by students who appreciate its mild flavor and comforting qualities, making it a staple beverage in academic environments. The latte is often seen as a comforting companion for those working on their studies or assignments, providing a sense of enjoyment and relaxation after a long day.

Overall, the latte is recognized as a favorite beverage among students, known for its ability to enhance focus and provide comfort while engaging in academic work. Its popularity at Brokenside Cafe further solidifies its status as a beloved choice for those seeking a delightful coffee experience.</data>
