    <node id="DEPOT SANTO YUSUP">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Depot Santo Yusup is a restaurant that specializes in Chinese congee and is part of the Gang Djangkrik group. It is well-known for its variety of congee dishes, including popular options such as the century egg variation, which is often served with traditional accompaniments like youtiao (fried dough sticks), pickles, and spring onions. The establishment is recognized for its delicious food, particularly its comforting congee, which is favored by many customers, including students seeking warmth and comfort. Depot Santo Yusup offers a range of congee variations, making it a popular dining choice for those looking for good food in a cozy atmosphere.</data>
