    <node id="CENTURY EGG">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Century egg is a traditional Chinese delicacy that is often used as a topping for congee, a popular rice porridge. It is well-known for its unique flavor and texture, which many people appreciate. At locations such as Depot Santo Yusup, century egg is particularly favored as a topping, enhancing the overall experience of the dish. This preserved egg adds a distinctive taste that complements the congee, making it a beloved choice among those who enjoy traditional Chinese cuisine.</data>
