    <node id="YOUTIAO">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Youtiao is a type of Chinese deep-fried dough that is commonly served with congee, a rice porridge. This dish adds a crispy texture and a salty flavor to the meal, enhancing the overall dining experience. Youtiao is often enjoyed for its ability to complement the soft and smooth consistency of congee, making it a popular choice in Chinese cuisine.</data>
      <data key="d2">03494060bdfc669bd34cb19c0dca6f63,07b97d0053f95f256b21a57ff44ce052,0cca408c60e568cbb2187ec3c322f26f,0ed4c47475e7b506d102f9ea927b39e1,176090d849cf45256363fa540052ea42,18e9c1f8ea47d8982b5d279d74ba6871,277f4b810dfdb484c64d54ce5cf8e53a,2b4a323e7ff051910dba4cc895bd511e,3acf1b044b10f5e75e7758c80781a679,3dcf67377e9a9bf932325ef5bf4a652a,3fdf23a6184e16d24280d859823a5dc8,40fc002513ce70e43ae26968774e26d4,4177f8c2583889f8cb31ad6a3e8c3fb0,4c2a308b5aa6e31576856e60b71db6d7,51ea5e6bd8d4cf63d04421e83c47f409,544e30e59f5665eda06c5cda4965cafe,5e21adcd5dd413f22f795f34b68ac16e,5f5b8749071d6fc19d4a88b7dd48acc6,6535a47f24fb87e74b24959b89b13f90,72901573685a29ff5843ba39e0d58664,7707f8e1c1d89e16f66b60b577d5f70d,7e92ccc1a40241c0dd83eece9cc3de1b,7f6cbb1b72a66ece29cdfb7db1ff7f0e,824cfd1348d773ba98993656dd7b024e,868a2b18c9fb125d54b09d85db056fd7,8830c9e2ec6544b2247dde33d87031bd,8d942a21006d8644932200fa73f36708,91b1c3c034bed456425bde556be9b78e,a1a1be479d5210cbc8af6d7d1666bd63,ace0c2478f9cef339d38138b71e04feb,b5e5b5e148368158557990913c61a35c,b88c9a2cde595a10e4e98e78f0249bb5,be0c982f5b54d9ae7866255d70a4c96c,be286e88b66bc14ec1acfd09f21784c5,bf0d29f1e4c04b38ead1f8b756474b53,d945f9838c3cc2b77949fbbeeef33bed,dc29d023f7dc636f009bcd3ccbcf16e2,f9a826945fcc6cf4a4ea53237dfa83e5,fc68f81b2f4a9b9572711c9985753ffb</data>
