    <node id="BROKENSIDE CAFE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Brokenside Cafe is a local cafe located in front of the doraemon door of SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup Malang, known for its food and beverages offered at reasonable prices. The cafe is particularly popular among students and locals, appealing to them with its comforting atmosphere and a variety of offerings, including its well-loved mild lattes. The environment is designed to be welcoming and comfortable, making it an ideal spot for students to relax, study, or socialize. Brokenside Cafe has established itself as a community favorite, recognized for its pleasant ambiance and the quality of its drinks and snacks. Overall, it serves as a vibrant gathering place for those seeking affordable and enjoyable food and beverages.</data>
