    <node id="DORAEMON DOOR">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">The Doraemon door is a prominent landmark situated in front of Brokenside Cafe, which serves as a significant point of reference for the local community, particularly for students and customers. This door not only indicates the cafe's location but also enhances its appeal, making it easily recognizable. The Doraemon door is associated with the nearby school, where food and beverages are sold, further solidifying its role as a landmark in the area. Overall, the Doraemon door is recognized by the community as an essential marker that helps guide visitors to Brokenside Cafe and serves as a familiar sight for those frequenting the school and the cafe.</data>
