    <node id="DOUGHNUTS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Doughnuts are a beloved type of sweet fried dough pastry that the author enjoys baking, particularly for family celebrations such as birthdays. This signature recipe holds a special place in the author's heart, symbolizing a deep personal connection to family traditions and culinary practices. The preparation of doughnuts requires time and patience, showcasing the author's baking skills and love for creating memorable experiences during family gatherings. Often made for celebrations, these sweet treats not only highlight the author's culinary talent but also represent the joy and effort put into family celebrations, making them a cherished part of the family's festive occasions.</data>
