    <node id="RACING DRIVER">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">A racing driver is an individual who competes in motorsport events, particularly in Formula 1, where they face significant and extreme risks and challenges during each race. These drivers showcase remarkable skill and bravery as they navigate the high-stakes environment of competitive racing. The nature of their profession involves not only the thrill of speed but also the necessity to manage the inherent dangers associated with the sport. In addition to their technical abilities, racing drivers often exhibit charisma, which contributes to their appeal both on and off the track.</data>
      <data key="d2">0611ddd144652542cb1548b7ff2c9b71,13e919bae091af4114da302be23e5b13,30170150da560790adda3a8bbe3f84e1,49d2556d40b55f4ae9baeec8a9fd02cb,599e4072a896751b9d5b66fa161dc66d,6a1d17a9e204cfc2377a2d48025115c0,833560d79ab2fdeb2458c30223c92fa1,867497f3a7fa726d0bbe8465e3d847c4,927734574f64d61036eb0de915267195,9b1ee635150689f9c3ea81d3385482c3,a3daa81ac9a1a09ae59d06a5bb632790,a9aa79741087537cf8bb6a069d7bdf38,ac41c398e26132401b34dac56fa7cc8b,b75c9afa52944c218653fb743bb03b6d,cc2a960a055205c232a71d7fbc547ebf,d0470488e65ba060066549997c5f228e</data>
