    <node id="LIDYA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Lidya is a full-time student at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup Malang. She actively balances her academic responsibilities with various organizational activities. In addition to her studies, Lidya engages in a range of hobbies, which she pursues as a way to reward herself for her achievements.</data>
