    <node id="NETFLIX">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Netflix is a prominent streaming service recognized for its extensive selection of films, television series, anime, and documentaries. It features a diverse array of award-winning content available on thousands of internet-connected devices. Among its popular offerings is the series "Drive to Survive," which provides an in-depth look at Formula 1 racing. Netflix's catalog includes a wide variety of genres, ensuring that there is something for everyone, from gripping dramas to engaging documentaries.</data>
      <data key="d2">335740df3ad0ecbd7752a205c03ba7c8,39b1b4909a6ebe9157409bb510254805,453f52c41f58b8d026599e199b249bda,6028f0ad54a4807a83070bf372e102fd,8337b0890db838153afb32040a81e6dd,87b55664f8844c49258357c852055db3,8f160e572f1ae3d74b2b0aed1423a0a2,922aa233e4f6bd82b9af14cf30ff5b8c,ac553e00caf3f7c66b66689004b88200,c02f2d194f43580925f7b5c12f4f5e59,dbd36804f99886987379717dfea4b4cd,e35bd2c7055e90f33bd44993bbbd1a1a,e70637601b58e7e4f195d92572dc2700,ee374d4742743504e7def99a6f66db96,f32f72013398bea4c6f2d221f8d64dd5,f4f429aac477b1262e06f3b8c3aeb0b3</data>
