    <node id="FAMILY TRIP">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">A family trip is a cherished holiday tradition in which family members travel together to explore new countries, typically lasting 1-2 weeks. These trips often serve as a reward for academic achievements or efforts, reinforcing family bonds and creating lasting memories. The tradition emphasizes the importance of spending quality time together, allowing families to celebrate accomplishments while discovering new cultures and experiences. For the author, family trips are a significant aspect of their holiday celebrations, providing opportunities to strengthen relationships and enjoy shared adventures.</data>
      <data key="d2">05e24b43fdc7a81f5525f90db81260a8,1298217c2ef9c333cbc2ab8cc4ebaba7,354e17446aefa055d4a3861588dc7558,36fffeb00f9dc83745d38e55ed2be20e,3de52c6928566893f87d83ce2e81c21a,40e0fac55533fac29c7b99bf1b172f86,51956617ad3a565edc8bd5d3e0c66be4,523c6232a21d8d940288c4f27d411a2b,584d1b6046df29154cf177b255337180,58d5651c3abdb74e3f0cf92b2dd0dde3,5f180ab9541ddc075bbb64cdbe37b1a2,809305e103324f18b85bbfb7433dfda1,83d5cb28ae8b3c28d721421eb5d29cfd,87d8923b3d9520a851d9745d430ad43c,8abe6231b542f8ee9438e2b0de97e988,8eaaf074b3dee3e8c486c0f22e7e0f80,91d8af1ef4354a1eb8b414791a795e0d,962e11759df05515f7e161bfbfa556f8,a0c3b82463936aecdeee6bb09890c1e8,a56679eec8d12ef6e22807f2673fbe97,aaf3a0a17c8a81e405d4bf5d0a52b8c3,adff67638e3e9f5ae49981dcdf993411,b0138efccb36f40e6865c6798d69f90b,b25e57265d365bf725ecc29df3e63fbd,b430c01f6663595d78fdf8ccd47456e4,b917a8c7d3a8d70548c8a7421a013d3f,c34e1566e0cf16930e809db5f045f198,d52a6954b8b06a8270e7bea4939bad54,e20d0b841012aeecda27abf81debca24,ebb14d045c691755fdd9ffc8206d3cbc</data>
