    <node id="F1 CAR">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">An F1 car is a specialized high-performance racing vehicle designed specifically for Formula 1 races. It is engineered to achieve exceptional speed and performance, capable of withstanding extreme G-forces during races. F1 cars are also characterized by their quick pit stops, which are crucial for maintaining competitive advantage in the fast-paced environment of Formula 1 racing.</data>
      <data key="d2">0fdcac5db1638dc4e1dec03f341092c8,b75c9afa52944c218653fb743bb03b6d</data>
