    <node id="CAFE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">The CAFE is a newly established culinary spot located near the school's parking lot, which has quickly gained popularity among students. It is well-known for its delicious cookies and offers a variety of other snacks and beverages, including lattes and congee. The cafe is appreciated for its reasonable prices, making it an attractive option for students looking for a casual dining experience after school. With its focus on providing light meals and snacks, the CAFE serves as a comfortable gathering place for students, contributing to its status as a favored local establishment in the school area.</data>
      <data key="d2">0cc1a75f9e16e474b33a1a5d415cae33,1694e4ecfe310223860ffd6f96398d08,1815aa8a8d01851062ea4114d8c69e7a,1b39394fc83c6c28f351b59cb5797d26,220d09baa5089a943ac339a2340d2f7d,28acc61ea721188ba7d0248df6c1c6bb,38b394c1988b8cfe4725c418abe26f2c,6e3516d89d90313f31790d2376e1e840,76c7bc45256648795bd309bb31945c9b,81943256c18c61184f737f489eb68e93,8486f7581459448b2a88d1f1782c3448,92a0b1356cbee9d3f43897a1ce712aed,a21ccfea4e7d697742f707631cadc322,a2d99cbdbc2a7582c0ce01420a1782c7,a95a833603e0826daef19f23dd74d857,b037c4c7259602f570d870652647188f,b315a66cec4f08b834e41b2e441394ca,ba2bba262e9c1e4133777917c75704be,c82758f9717a22ccf50951b95f4809f2,fe38efe2c512b4b97a31d295c776811f</data>
