    <node id="FAMILY">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The family is a close-knit social unit comprised of individuals related by blood or marriage, who share a strong bond and engage in various activities together. Central to their experiences are celebrations of birthdays and holidays, where they come together to create lasting memories. The family enjoys traveling, often exploring new countries and cultures during their vacations, which has been a cherished tradition since childhood. 

In addition to traveling, the family partakes in shared activities such as baking and gathering for meals, further strengthening their connections. Their collective experiences highlight the importance of togetherness, as they celebrate special occasions and embark on trips that foster love and support among family members. Overall, the family's commitment to celebrating milestones and exploring the world together underscores the significance of their relationships and shared traditions.</data>
      <data key="d2">0589bbd70863dd7630ccb9aff0f53f06,0c4fd833b2c72fc838c50c7e3f72955f,130b3a77d55d874d70c5bbb3a6782131,131b7b2680890537fba3a1d83b8ac8b0,13e919bae091af4114da302be23e5b13,1546dc726272fa5ad12c015d304f9baa,20369baf540661b11521e9f6cf761b8f,21eec60508b6674069686aeb2ce2319c,22af1e3afbd6c99e7a64d9b56401f7a6,24186881ecac61dc8fdbd2f020712407,264305f71f6896a071c2bb57ad263602,2e6e27b59c32d179364c8bd0a9f9669a,2f5c1e996782ed805f1d99accbc22552,32078b4406a30176681fa6fe72094999,3561f6a2c1516cda18dca7bbfadf09c8,65312bcce6caff605853d2b6483a122b,694f5f766001236f80266c5fcc8e6c04,6a1d17a9e204cfc2377a2d48025115c0,6a8c23020f2b3cc95b345b0221630ca9,7e45e7bb6e5afb800323805754c30ef7,833560d79ab2fdeb2458c30223c92fa1,8421b82b30ffe5b2115f8a80a75a59f6,85d0264476f23da17d7774620dbd3fd1,85ff57441ddc1e06c4db6e630b28a23b,867497f3a7fa726d0bbe8465e3d847c4,8db5de7042856d7e022df2cf850739cf,9284d39c7b3871988cd3a90376747477,96978c6fe8a74d75238f958a3e8c56e1,9b1ee635150689f9c3ea81d3385482c3,9b2562c22a323916dba8b2a6b0389f07,a3daa81ac9a1a09ae59d06a5bb632790,aef86feb6ba28a6e231bc3236665b56b,ba4b33538bc0e6f778a71796b28adaa4,bb2569ab4b18cb9ad3c494aa6aa06c62,bc130ad9c5a8a1650e6a0f53de3cc7aa,be44e57cc021fad58d5bfe581d0fff7b,bfca6d9c5e41fc8323401408017a400e,c1266b877e7fc1278c16db627ea44864,c3c582579618bc4ce6dc793b516f2d5b,c7d3f9ed2f268a447eb55e426dffc48d,cd4130b63dbe05d06b9a4e944d980654,d0470488e65ba060066549997c5f228e,d19b5571bf371ff41f492abae03a2798,d61e3c1da9bea8557769f021bc506105,db6ee4521d72b86ec885fd18525d99c6,dd4554bc78b0e6a16d55db58077f348f,e752509d5281b7262e69900d90e120f5,e921db892ca9ba11bf2134d96bdd9ea9,eb1422dcdf03f4c577c8f5bc1aef6496,f162c5b6c0b0973327d4b625b87885f3,f6bba854969026a59cc3cb69fb06aee1</data>
