    <node id="COUNTRY">
      <data key="d0">GEO</data>
      <data key="d1">A country is defined as a destination for exploration and cultural experiences, often attracting visitors with its unique cuisine and diverse landscapes. It serves as a popular choice for family trips, where families typically travel for 1-2 weeks to discover new cultures and culinary delights. During these holidays, families engage in exploration, immersing themselves in the local culture and enjoying various experiences that each country has to offer.

The term "country" is a general reference to any nation or region that individuals or families may choose to visit during their travels. It embodies a sense of adventure and discovery, representing a wide array of destinations that families explore while seeking new experiences and cultural insights. The author, for instance, travels to different countries during family holidays, emphasizing the importance of exploring new cultures and cuisines as part of their travel experiences.

In summary, a country is not only a geographical entity but also a rich source of cultural experiences, culinary adventures, and family bonding opportunities during trips. It represents the diverse nations that families visit, each offering unique attractions and experiences to be discovered.</data>
      <data key="d2">0589bbd70863dd7630ccb9aff0f53f06,1044897ebc4ac9add30be03f058e2bfb,125daab50b196a5ce70cdcafc825c43c,131b7b2680890537fba3a1d83b8ac8b0,20369baf540661b11521e9f6cf761b8f,21eec60508b6674069686aeb2ce2319c,24186881ecac61dc8fdbd2f020712407,264305f71f6896a071c2bb57ad263602,32078b4406a30176681fa6fe72094999,3561f6a2c1516cda18dca7bbfadf09c8,65312bcce6caff605853d2b6483a122b,66dbb29b709fbb04faec50d2d0aee953,6837d6e16341391f8a4c25f46468abc5,6a8c23020f2b3cc95b345b0221630ca9,7159806b81899f6d675ede644f351602,7d5203f48866f1d50466602d5d394546,7e45e7bb6e5afb800323805754c30ef7,7f537ae333b91685edeef81aae12cdce,8421b82b30ffe5b2115f8a80a75a59f6,85ff57441ddc1e06c4db6e630b28a23b,9284d39c7b3871988cd3a90376747477,a3daa81ac9a1a09ae59d06a5bb632790,ba4b33538bc0e6f778a71796b28adaa4,bc130ad9c5a8a1650e6a0f53de3cc7aa,be44e57cc021fad58d5bfe581d0fff7b,c3c582579618bc4ce6dc793b516f2d5b,c7d3f9ed2f268a447eb55e426dffc48d,d0470488e65ba060066549997c5f228e,e921db892ca9ba11bf2134d96bdd9ea9,eb1422dcdf03f4c577c8f5bc1aef6496,ef1bbbfc8f2a5bf434f5f6762bc9a2ee,f162c5b6c0b0973327d4b625b87885f3,f6bba854969026a59cc3cb69fb06aee1</data>
