    <node id="BAKER">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "BAKER" refers to an individual who is passionate about baking and finds joy in the process of creating various baked goods. A baker typically specializes in preparing and baking a range of items, including bread, pastries, and desserts, with a particular fondness for homemade doughnuts. This individual often enjoys the act of mixing ingredients and the overall experience of baking, which serves as a source of happiness and a form of stress relief. The baker takes pleasure in working in their own kitchen, where they can express their creativity and love for baking. Overall, the baker is characterized by their enthusiasm for the craft and the joy they derive from making delicious treats.</data>
      <data key="d2">1850b7e224012a7131d8ffe770c32254,19555ee122101f5f31a9e8c46e83a331,24687f2d2dd0a529b751d25443008b58,39b1b4909a6ebe9157409bb510254805,47f5d5c786cb928cc6d38a96dfe530f4,499249e2f38b44f84444a386ddc82229,4c81830877edf04490f74342b608787b,615c41f77a8d5e9017f17b2c660ede8a,895b1e453e53a821fcacd87a1d5be2bf,8c0ed4bdb0d845f924a0aeeb1b889d47,922aa233e4f6bd82b9af14cf30ff5b8c,9451c3741c42f857c3c244565a7fde64,9a6cbc27534d6f979fe6fb20f030efda,9bfd1a0777a9cbdc794ea2798adb5ae9,b878d0827f5266108d0eb58adf7a8489,c5bb5dca7e22cc59e20a6dc73d072fcb,cd224a2e171d846f471a6abce6d2ca66,dfbd2e1adeb8ba7294271218feb33228,ee374d4742743504e7def99a6f66db96,eedc9caf55693099b85218b86f4a19f2,f2d94597a79ccdec2b87e066e439f07d,f83adb5f7e926aa7a2a98239fdbf4e45,fd73f85dec2658fdb9cae0a485a4469c,fe48e8ee78e0a35dee70d1ee8e3492f7</data>
