    <node id="SMAK KOLESE SANTO">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">SMAK Kolese Santo is an educational institution located in Indonesia, where students attend to receive their education in a supportive environment. The school is noted for its involvement in various activities, including potentially participating in the country's 79th birthday celebrations, highlighting its engagement with national events and community spirit.</data>
      <data key="d2">2ea91fdb3c2b0ee2422aa32b83d6a85d,d945f9838c3cc2b77949fbbeeef33bed</data>
      <data key="d3">3</data>
      <data key="d4">0</data>
      <data key="d5">2</data>
      <data key="d6">47</data>
      <data key="d7">83a6cb03df6b41d8ad6ee5f6fef5f024</data>
    </node>
    <node id="STUDENTS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Students are individuals enrolled in educational institutions who actively engage in a variety of academic and extracurricular activities. At SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup, students participate in events that celebrate their country's independence, such as flag ceremonies and Independence Day celebrations. These events often include games, fashion shows, and culinary experiences, allowing students to showcase their creativity, teamwork, and national pride.

During the flag ceremonies, students honor Indonesia's independence, with some volunteering as flag bearers, demonstrating their commitment and teamwork. They also take on various roles in school events, contributing to the design and execution of shows, and supporting their classmates in competitions and performances. Through these activities, students not only enhance their organizational skills but also foster a sense of community and patriotism.

Overall, students at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup are involved in a rich array of activities that reflect their dedication to both their education and their cultural heritage, participating in events that celebrate their identity and engage them in meaningful ways.</data>
      <data key="d2">0436d157c36f0c167f03e7d5b8e94ef1,0bc65b38d62fffeb5682724d960c8700,0bd5cd57a4c728798fe84357b9d3bc1f,0de1865d7b8918193a29a5c1cf3482c9,0f1a44748c878143b677345ebf156e3e,0f962a8aa6bec77883242c5204796a32,0fd934d3e2b3b6088374d0feffd8217e,11d2fbbcb307a708107645f2d451d94c,12cb4fd83f59fe74a6b72cc7ce224104,133c3bee64c1597b10a246cb94fdc711,13af617ce41b58ea9127db549cd1d2f1,197406b7b5e629de843fb521a2929765,1d6d1ff07d90bfbdd5695e395bd9ade7,1f1cdfe4b8e1f6eee16177a096ccbce0,1fc0f667540ded153065389b2ff02fed,210d56189237484bceecd976284cd1eb,215309d174ba0952bffd23c260811381,2265c1fef143a4ff686a0365450634c0,2368d40fcef631d429c61eccf05bff96,28acc61ea721188ba7d0248df6c1c6bb,2b8d117db7fef2447c0edbb1e9ac9124,2bf27cda406546e7298279ada16574ea,2f3af3335990a23a07bef3566bb90c78,2f6d039a392b0ee79bd424269c04a7fc,31fcc83610260d5cbe445fb4e6442126,3296ee5862d62286f946bbf765949a93,3326909c7d12deca65de1f2fc4372617,361a99abe9ba5b02b7e22fdf2d2c8e6c,37e3dde6d3737069918926405f367ff0,3aea96f21552eb00a6fb9126d682a973,3bf8fc7d99d6f99a259ea052e75fb136,3d3fa30026f147fae6e4199717e22c9d,42eb76afc88c3a91aeee4f194f2b4458,4444bcdbdb7937999c01cb7e8da5f5f2,489237f470431504cf780ad2161d4ae9,4931f7faffbddd544f98493074e45459,4bcb05697834c0964fc114e2e4234089,5314163c424df79e7c31c670221b229c,54a54dd160a4335258e12b621669ab9c,5b87ba5f7766a00f4b6653a957771163,5d7fd6f9c3e34f372ccc0fb626cd3bbd,60508ad08aa78809fdc256536c335961,60d8e1932e48f81e4c42c2a60d8fbe28,6111385dcb1ac8b3b91653baf1146abb,653c9dff6d9827485379c29285cffd2b,65d4853a2962f3a692250cbe02ed2646,679e6e0841249a033be46d6828241466,72ce1099a3ac33be669483fa6061fbd9,7447b5a0990afaa41fbb55c70a92649c,76c7bc45256648795bd309bb31945c9b,77b410d543f58747f304622f54d7e485,781e8c2addfc0f439b3c7cfe8a763de1,7990bfd88125d6a67970e4b817a0d68e,7abfccbd7d46003a8ccffad1520ef750,7f9e5d048ca91c76408994ac6ae687d2,814f3c8159bf0c666ad38820c6bc25d3,839ba0343dc5c5ce683c68ecefac15f7,84f6dbd7cc1745b968b47b60271d3f11,86dae4a7725894005dfa64de6343b75f,88385b7d8551f794ee971fa7947cbc28