    <node id="TEACHERS">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Teachers are dedicated educators at the school who play a vital role in guiding and supporting students in their academic pursuits and extracurricular activities. They are actively involved in various school events, including the flag ceremony, which honors Indonesia's independence. During this ceremony, teachers participate alongside students and staff, contributing to the organization and execution of the event while appreciating the students' efforts and performances.

In addition to the flag ceremony, teachers also oversee and provide feedback during events such as the Fashion Show, where they recognize and appreciate the creativity and hard work of the students. They offer guidance and support throughout these activities, ensuring that students feel valued and encouraged in their endeavors.

At SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup, teachers specifically acknowledge the students' efforts in costume design and performances during the Fashion Show, reinforcing their commitment to fostering a supportive learning environment. Overall, teachers in Indonesia are instrumental in guiding students during national celebrations and school events, providing both appreciation and constructive feedback to enhance the students' educational experiences.</data>
      <data key="d2">0436d157c36f0c167f03e7d5b8e94ef1,0f1a44748c878143b677345ebf156e3e,0f962a8aa6bec77883242c5204796a32,0fd934d3e2b3b6088374d0feffd8217e,11d2fbbcb307a708107645f2d451d94c,133c3bee64c1597b10a246cb94fdc711,13af617ce41b58ea9127db549cd1d2f1,1d6d1ff07d90bfbdd5695e395bd9ade7,1fc0f667540ded153065389b2ff02fed,2265c1fef143a4ff686a0365450634c0,2368d40fcef631d429c61eccf05bff96,28acc61ea721188ba7d0248df6c1c6bb,2b8d117db7fef2447c0edbb1e9ac9124,2bf27cda406546e7298279ada16574ea,2f3af3335990a23a07bef3566bb90c78,2f6d039a392b0ee79bd424269c04a7fc,31fcc83610260d5cbe445fb4e6442126,361a99abe9ba5b02b7e22fdf2d2c8e6c,3bf8fc7d99d6f99a259ea052e75fb136,3d3fa30026f147fae6e4199717e22c9d,42eb76afc88c3a91aeee4f194f2b4458,489237f470431504cf780ad2161d4ae9,4931f7faffbddd544f98493074e45459,5314163c424df79e7c31c670221b229c,54a54dd160a4335258e12b621669ab9c,5d7fd6f9c3e34f372ccc0fb626cd3bbd,60d8e1932e48f81e4c42c2a60d8fbe28,6111385dcb1ac8b3b91653baf1146abb,65d4853a2962f3a692250cbe02ed2646,679e6e0841249a033be46d6828241466,72ce1099a3ac33be669483fa6061fbd9,76c7bc45256648795bd309bb31945c9b,781e8c2addfc0f439b3c7cfe8a763de1,7990bfd88125d6a67970e4b817a0d68e,7abfccbd7d46003a8ccffad1520ef750,7f9e5d048ca91c76408994ac6ae687d2,839ba0343dc5c5ce683c68ecefac15f7,86dae4a7725894005dfa64de6343b75f,885507fff269673d5ff2ed923b86254b,8b8ae71a06c5ff7d186bcde202035082,91424a527238b3537137d8f5d159e2c1,a1b718066b0e79b13af5ac431be6b13b,adcbd0799926176937fddfc9245cf403,adf324e3226f6c5755c6dcc6c8bc88fe,afabfec482129115e569ec321f9c945d,ba2bba262e9c1e4133777917c75704be,bad6864065b7db339635eb094e4c7748,bc2f3b06116e3b6d2056f69dc54eca89,c0340350cb4b5de43d16482a265a8c61,c4dd622774946512e1467438e438c8bf,c57df0c90bdd4e9a839dc92cc96f10e0,d57cea43c9c3c80465ff077ab7e3e3c9,db979be172c6b5f6acc734d93ffcef12,e1ee9832c6ce1dae5f9ebb38e8b515bb,e7b46f329b9a3a4932f3f5480349fcc1,ebf804c2b3e89f31aaeb73067990b442,f49201eb3c70adafb517a4ca27a458e7,f52a53a804698e666d10d2f09b8671da,f74af2f982497a52bc9afe3e772e4813,fbb6738ee062a6577dc7bd0efdedb341