    <node id="MARIA">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Maria is a full-time student at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup Malang. She is actively involved in various organizational activities, demonstrating her commitment to her education and community. In addition to her academic pursuits, Maria enjoys a range of personal interests, including baking, traveling, and streaming. She values the happiness that these hobbies bring to her life, reflecting her well-rounded character and dedication to both her studies and personal growth.</data>
      <data key="d2">8715a3b7da1f582e7d89e0024390510b,a034369530f21d646c3d2b97aadf5912</data>
