    <node id="COFFEE SHOPS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Coffee shops are culinary businesses that serve a variety of coffee drinks and desserts made from processed coffee beans. They are establishments that not only serve coffee and coffee-based beverages but also often process coffee beans for commercial use. In Indonesia, coffee shops play a significant role in the coffee industry, frequently utilizing high-quality Indonesian coffee beans to create their offerings. These establishments specialize in providing customers with a range of coffee and related products, ensuring a focus on quality and the unique flavors of Indonesian coffee. Overall, coffee shops are integral to the culinary landscape, offering a diverse selection of coffee and beverages to satisfy customer preferences.</data>
      <data key="d2">0253f3eca3c9a192495431566eda2dfa,0d53ba4c17d87cbb6cddc011b7c280af,11b480126ee4cefd4b46538150d083c9,173b1ecbf2a744d097ae168edbaf17e1,17e89bec04a1876b8607739403e43ec1,220d09baa5089a943ac339a2340d2f7d,25996f4ebebf3106a557db852ca8c800,2874a340a4164d3a59c5eb2140a802a1,2c9e51ac63bb54781711b825480f82b1,2cc6639219b38939e6cfa3931f4b2dd8,453e3b14da5190213752d4a3c765713c,462d6a8b60a6a4ecff27cb32773f10d8,542b8405c327415ab4413b34b804cd65,57cd77081d35192f4344b6b9f4126d5b,5a0f4bf4dfc81c7b3c555f39ec5e42b7,6e3516d89d90313f31790d2376e1e840,704c28a5054b0e7f75df85d4eee62380,775f71c2030c26d2dd92cc8c9d4765d0,77682508a87255141a4e2fb6666e0c6d,78abc5585914d7787dbd78635275b970,82748d0f6a5eae1db4ece21d6134dceb,8b8e06d930721dfc278218ba4df82929,a78535a60b9725781bbe79bb3981d18e,b3a7b340444c8cc452a889f82f6c8be3,bddfd859689e0e612747bab511c58cbd,de34fb3f94fcc48d3c86048fa55fd08e,e433fe087f0fcf1087745b1d395b7650,eae22077f472221cde688a6379cf4359</data>
