    <node id="CAFES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Cafes are casual dining establishments that primarily serve coffee and light meals or snacks to patrons. They play a significant role in the coffee culture, particularly in Indonesia, where many cafes feature Indonesian coffee prominently in their offerings. These establishments often use high-quality coffee beans and may even process coffee beans for their menu items. In addition to coffee, cafes typically offer a variety of beverages and light refreshments, contributing to a relaxed dining experience for customers. Overall, cafes are characterized by their focus on coffee and light meals, making them popular spots for socializing and enjoying casual dining.</data>
      <data key="d2">0253f3eca3c9a192495431566eda2dfa,0d53ba4c17d87cbb6cddc011b7c280af,11b480126ee4cefd4b46538150d083c9,173b1ecbf2a744d097ae168edbaf17e1,17e89bec04a1876b8607739403e43ec1,25996f4ebebf3106a557db852ca8c800,2874a340a4164d3a59c5eb2140a802a1,2c9e51ac63bb54781711b825480f82b1,2cc6639219b38939e6cfa3931f4b2dd8,453e3b14da5190213752d4a3c765713c,462d6a8b60a6a4ecff27cb32773f10d8,542b8405c327415ab4413b34b804cd65,57cd77081d35192f4344b6b9f4126d5b,5a0f4bf4dfc81c7b3c555f39ec5e42b7,704c28a5054b0e7f75df85d4eee62380,775f71c2030c26d2dd92cc8c9d4765d0,77682508a87255141a4e2fb6666e0c6d,78abc5585914d7787dbd78635275b970,82748d0f6a5eae1db4ece21d6134dceb,8b8e06d930721dfc278218ba4df82929,a78535a60b9725781bbe79bb3981d18e,b3a7b340444c8cc452a889f82f6c8be3,bddfd859689e0e612747bab511c58cbd,de34fb3f94fcc48d3c86048fa55fd08e,e433fe087f0fcf1087745b1d395b7650,eae22077f472221cde688a6379cf4359</data>
