    <node id="17AN">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The entity "17AN" refers to a series of events and celebrations held in Indonesia to commemorate Independence Day, particularly on August 17th. This event features a variety of activities, including games and competitions, in which students participate in various roles. The 17AN event is characterized by its festive atmosphere, incorporating a fashion show alongside the games, allowing students to engage actively in the celebrations. Overall, 17AN serves as a vibrant celebration of Indonesia's Independence Day, marked by community involvement and a spirit of competition.</data>
      <data key="d2">0bc65b38d62fffeb5682724d960c8700,0f1a44748c878143b677345ebf156e3e,1b7e39977ed2f3e081fb9df93278a82a,210d56189237484bceecd976284cd1eb,87f28ff4a25779a71db886bcc939810a,99ad3569de188d0c9c9160563b0a7349,a66dd9fecf0b93a9acd9925376df3cb5,afabfec482129115e569ec321f9c945d,db979be172c6b5f6acc734d93ffcef12,ffe6e59f1f9190727e6033b19d17326f</data>
