    <node id="STAFF">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">The "STAFF" refers to the personnel working in schools in Indonesia who play a vital role in supporting educational activities and events. They are actively involved in organizing and participating in various ceremonies, particularly the flag ceremony that honors Indonesia's independence. Staff members assist in the overall organization and execution of these events, contributing significantly to the school community.

During the Independence Day ceremony, staff members collaborate with students and teachers, participating alongside them to celebrate and honor the nation's independence. Their involvement includes not only organizing the flag ceremony but also supporting the educational environment and ensuring the smooth operation of school activities. Through their contributions, staff members help foster a sense of community and patriotism within the school, making them integral to the celebration of national events like the flag ceremony.</data>
      <data key="d2">0436d157c36f0c167f03e7d5b8e94ef1,13af617ce41b58ea9127db549cd1d2f1,1fc0f667540ded153065389b2ff02fed,2265c1fef143a4ff686a0365450634c0,2bf27cda406546e7298279ada16574ea,2f3af3335990a23a07bef3566bb90c78,2f6d039a392b0ee79bd424269c04a7fc,31fcc83610260d5cbe445fb4e6442126,3d3fa30026f147fae6e4199717e22c9d,42eb76afc88c3a91aeee4f194f2b4458,489237f470431504cf780ad2161d4ae9,4931f7faffbddd544f98493074e45459,5314163c424df79e7c31c670221b229c,54a54dd160a4335258e12b621669ab9c,60d8e1932e48f81e4c42c2a60d8fbe28,6111385dcb1ac8b3b91653baf1146abb,65d4853a2962f3a692250cbe02ed2646,679e6e0841249a033be46d6828241466,72ce1099a3ac33be669483fa6061fbd9,781e8c2addfc0f439b3c7cfe8a763de1,839ba0343dc5c5ce683c68ecefac15f7,885507fff269673d5ff2ed923b86254b,8b8ae71a06c5ff7d186bcde202035082,adf324e3226f6c5755c6dcc6c8bc88fe,afabfec482129115e569ec321f9c945d,bc2f3b06116e3b6d2056f69dc54eca89,c4dd622774946512e1467438e438c8bf,d57cea43c9c3c80465ff077ab7e3e3c9,ebf804c2b3e89f31aaeb73067990b442,f49201eb3c70adafb517a4ca27a458e7,ffb293fcdba436eeb8590ac444e74176</data>
