    <node id="CULINARY SPOTS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Culinary spots are food stalls that offer affordable and enjoyable food options for students after school. These stalls provide a variety of meals and snacks, often at reasonable prices, contributing to the daily sustenance of students. Known for their appealing offerings, culinary spots satisfy students' hunger and provide a convenient dining experience in the after-school hours.</data>
