    <node id="17TH OF AUGUST 2024">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The 17th of August 2024 marks the 79th anniversary of Indonesia's Independence Day celebration. This significant date will be commemorated with various activities that honor the country's independence, reflecting on its history and achievements since gaining freedom.</data>
      <data key="d2">207c9bf6d566900d095ab5d71f4da5e9,869d6c691c59e67e91564577e8a0aff8</data>
