    <node id="STREAMING APPS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Streaming apps are platforms that enable users to watch content online, playing a significant role in the leisure activities of the author. These apps are particularly valued for their ability to provide access to various forms of entertainment, including sports and hobbies. The author frequently utilizes streaming apps to enjoy F1 races from the comfort of home, highlighting their importance in enhancing the viewing experience of such events. By offering a wide range of content, streaming apps allow fans to engage with their favorite sports, including F1 racing, thereby enriching their overall entertainment experience.</data>
      <data key="d2">1f410d75d53925fc7ea47ee028e5d0c9,45327914ec35ab887fcfa695f2abd546,480f71aa57a464cb2c1d63ebb7541b38,5af08b83b0a2c976523a89c182df633a,9051e1c9f8716cbd3c1a6c4908f13837,af05965eae7ad19e2a45879e73716463,d77445f0c0e21d789a28084eb1426338,fb2f7cab257c2e41c09848020534a6a5</data>
