    <node id="INDEPENDENCE DAY">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Independence Day is a national holiday celebrated annually in Indonesia on August 17th. This significant day commemorates the country's declaration of independence and is marked by a variety of events and ceremonies. The celebrations include various festivities, games, competitions, and a flag ceremony, reflecting the spirit of national pride and unity. Overall, Independence Day serves as a momentous occasion for Indonesians to honor their history and celebrate their freedom.</data>
      <data key="d2">1d72f1c9fd5b80665b61f7b70e03d540,2e2b2cbfd928534c7c39c3d73e08d6c9,3326909c7d12deca65de1f2fc4372617,5443ae62a9df7629504cbdd4d9aa783e,582c786526ea5df290a864f2537fdae3,5cc1a795d601a7223bf23e2b993c6452,5f19feaa0396bff0bf4ec80ee067be37,7d8f4d05e488189c84e122577666c381,7ed28112092f149fd4997fcca2661eed,936a235164179a39fe1147f7b6900867,a4db3f612f67d050224cc2cb438dc5d1,b4b4f2c891d4fa45160af4c253b26e5e,b7f19838eb314a6c9059ffa22fa59559,b8af992b910560cec55fe5109d352070,ca16491e51d076ae8ad4d6a9b85af7a8,d1080e3d52e7d578e4d6252dc8f15e27,d28baa7f9ca811118ddb09add533b5dc,e6e1f4cfcb3ef9e99fab23bafe310543</data>
