    <node id="COOKIE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Cookies are a popular snack enjoyed by students, especially after school activities. They are particularly favored by students visiting a new cafe, where they often indulge in this treat following their school day. Overall, cookies have become a beloved choice for students looking for a tasty snack after school.</data>
