    <node id="YUSUP MALANG">
      <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
      <data key="d1">Yusup Malang is an individual actively involved in various organizational activities, demonstrating a commitment to making a personal impact through his engagements. In addition to his organizational pursuits, Yusup enjoys a variety of snacks and drinks, which play a significant role in his school journey. This enjoyment highlights the social aspect of sharing food with others, further enriching his experiences and interactions within his community.</data>
