    <node id="COFFEE BEANS">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Coffee beans are the processed seeds of coffee cherries, essential for making coffee drinks. They undergo a series of steps including roasting and milling before being prepared for consumption. The roasting process transforms the raw beans into a product suitable for brewing, while milling further refines them for culinary use. Coffee beans are integral to the coffee industry, serving as the primary ingredient in various coffee beverages.</data>
