      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The "COW OUTFIT" was a costume designed to creatively represent the raw ingredients of Rendang, a traditional dish. This outfit was specifically created for a school event, highlighting the culinary project's focus on showcasing the essential components of the dish.</data>
