    <node id="CHINESE CONGEE">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Chinese congee is a traditional dish celebrated for its comforting flavor and texture. It is typically served warm in a pot and can be topped with a variety of ingredients, including century egg, youtiao (fried dough sticks), salty pickles, crispy bits, and spring onions. This versatile dish is cherished for its ability to provide warmth and comfort, making it a popular choice among many.</data>
      <data key="d2">9f7633173f050a29acfec3065ec68b32,b36dc4410ac2a0075d8faf6e371d4b58,e71cc41516890e28c8c78e4de1482563</data>
