    <node id="TRAVELING">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Traveling refers to the act of going to different countries and exploring new cultures, cuisines, and experiences. It is an activity that individuals and families engage in, often during holidays, to discover and enjoy the excitement that comes with visiting new lands. Through traveling, individuals can immerse themselves in diverse cultural experiences and culinary delights, making it a fulfilling and enriching pursuit. Whether undertaken alone or as a family, traveling provides opportunities for adventure and personal growth, as well as the chance to create lasting memories together.</data>
      <data key="d2">0e9cb8fc1021c7d5795ddb037576f43d,22af1e3afbd6c99e7a64d9b56401f7a6,344ba73b167417efff0dbf0d142ce868,685c798022960e9200d4044e62179ea0,85d0264476f23da17d7774620dbd3fd1,bfca6d9c5e41fc8323401408017a400e,f589ae8554e26601c8ce184631d74912</data>
