    <node id="17TH OF AUGUST">
      <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
      <data key="d1">The 17th of August is the date on which Indonesia celebrates its Independence Day each year. This significant day marks the occasion of the impromptu flag ceremony that is held as part of the Independence Day celebrations, symbolizing the nation's freedom and sovereignty.</data>
