      <data key="d8">129.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup Malang is an educational institution where students engage in various activities alongside their studies. One such student enjoys baking homemade doughnuts, which serves as a personal hobby and a creative outlet. This activity provides a means of relaxation and stress relief amidst the responsibilities of academic life. The student finds joy in this hobby, using it as a way to reward themselves after their studies and to manage the pressures associated with being a student. Overall, baking homemade doughnuts is an integral part of their routine, allowing them to balance their educational commitments with a fulfilling personal interest.</data>
