    <edge source="FORMULA 1" target="RACING DRIVER">
      <data key="d8">125.0</data>
      <data key="d9">A racing driver competes in Formula 1 events, showcasing their skills and facing significant risks and challenges during races. These drivers participate in high-stakes competitions that embody the excitement and intensity of the sport. They are required to demonstrate exceptional driving abilities while navigating the extreme challenges associated with Formula 1 racing. Overall, racing drivers play a crucial role in the thrilling world of Formula 1, where they confront both the physical and mental demands of the sport.</data>
