    <edge source="FORMULA 1" target="NETFLIX">
      <data key="d8">165.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Formula 1 collaborates with Netflix to produce the series "Drive to Survive," which has significantly enhanced the sport's visibility and popularity among viewers. The series showcases the world of Formula 1 racing, highlighting the sport and its drivers, and has been instrumental in attracting a wider audience to Formula 1. As a result of this collaboration, Formula 1 content is readily available on Netflix, further contributing to its popularity on the platform. The success of "Drive to Survive" has not only increased the sport's visibility but has also solidified its connection with Netflix, making it a key player in promoting Formula 1 to a global audience.</data>
      <data key="d10">335740df3ad0ecbd7752a205c03ba7c8,39b1b4909a6ebe9157409bb510254805,453f52c41f58b8d026599e199b249bda,6028f0ad54a4807a83070bf372e102fd,8337b0890db838153afb32040a81e6dd,87b55664f8844c49258357c852055db3,8f160e572f1ae3d74b2b0aed1423a0a2,922aa233e4f6bd82b9af14cf30ff5b8c,ac553e00caf3f7c66b66689004b88200,c02f2d194f43580925f7b5c12f4f5e59,dbd36804f99886987379717dfea4b4cd,e35bd2c7055e90f33bd44993bbbd1a1a,ee374d4742743504e7def99a6f66db96,f32f72013398bea4c6f2d221f8d64dd5,f4f429aac477b1262e06f3b8c3aeb0b3</data>
      <data key="d11">eeb9c02c0efa4131b9e95d33c31019fc</data>
