      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FORMULA 1" target="HOMEMADE DOUGHNUT">
      <data key="d8">22.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The enjoyment of homemade doughnuts serves as a comforting activity for fans of high-stress events like Formula 1 races. This personal hobby contrasts with the high-speed excitement of Formula 1, providing a relaxing outlet for individuals who appreciate the thrill of the sport. After watching Formula 1, the act of baking and enjoying homemade doughnuts becomes a soothing ritual, allowing fans to unwind and find comfort amidst the adrenaline of the races. Thus, the enjoyment of homemade doughnuts not only complements the exhilarating experience of Formula 1 but also highlights a personal passion that offers relaxation and joy.</data>
      <data key="d10">00e544384b75f6a23f25ba042f6d2abb,76d43cc3ad5ee346db2c628d7fdce995,87b55664f8844c49258357c852055db3,90fc862c62f4df00a33e77bd10a96943,95e7b53f9c64e2c299fc9014dcbaa97a,ac439eb01408519e38b6ccf39e09a04a</data>
