      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="FORMULA 1" target="BAKING">
      <data key="d8">389.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The individual has a diverse range of interests, engaging in both Formula 1 and baking as hobbies that provide enjoyment and serve as effective stress relievers. While Formula 1 is characterized by its high-energy competitive nature, baking offers a contrasting, creative culinary pursuit. Both activities not only provide personal satisfaction but also teach valuable skills, such as competitive spirit, patience, and dedication, albeit in different contexts.

The author enjoys these hobbies for their unique contributions to their life&#8212;Formula 1 as a spectator sport that fuels excitement and baking as a personal hobby that fosters creativity. This combination showcases the individual's multifaceted personality and interests, highlighting how both hobbies can coexist and complement each other. The author often engages in baking as a way to unwind after watching Formula 1 races, indicating a personal connection between the two activities.

Overall, both Formula 1 and baking represent different aspects of the individual's life, appealing to their competitive nature and creative side, while also providing stress relief and enjoyment.</data>
