    <edge source="FORMULA 1" target="FAMILY">
      <data key="d8">205.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The author's family shares a strong bond through their mutual interest in Formula 1 racing. They enjoy watching races together, which allows them to share the excitement and adrenaline of the sport, enhancing their family connections. This shared enthusiasm for Formula 1 is not only a topic of discussion but also a significant part of their bonding activities, especially during holidays when they gather to watch or discuss the races.

In addition to watching Formula 1, the family enjoys spending time together through various activities, including traveling. Their travels often include attending Formula 1 events, which further solidifies their shared interest in the sport and creates lasting memories. Whether they are watching races at home or experiencing the thrill of live events, Formula 1 serves as a central theme in their family experiences, contributing to their enjoyment of each other's company and strengthening their familial ties.</data>
