    <edge source="FORMULA 1" target="COUNTRY">
      <data key="d8">22.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Formula 1 is a global motorsport phenomenon that takes place in various countries around the world. These countries host Formula 1 races, providing opportunities for exploration and cultural experiences for fans and travelers alike. The events attract a diverse audience, allowing attendees to immerse themselves in the unique cultures and environments of each host nation. The excitement of Formula 1 racing is not only about the competition on the track but also about the vibrant experiences that come with visiting different locations. Overall, Formula 1 races serve as a showcase of international culture and a celebration of the sport, making it a truly global event.</data>
