    <edge source="FORMULA 1" target="AUSTRALIA">
      <data key="d8">94.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Formula 1 races are frequently held in Australia, establishing the country as a significant location within the motorsport scene. These events not only highlight Australia's vibrant motorsport culture but also attract fans and tourists from around the world, enhancing the country's involvement in the sport. The atmosphere during these races is lively, showcasing the enthusiasm of both local and international spectators. Additionally, for those who enjoy traveling, attending Formula 1 events in Australia is a popular activity, further solidifying the nation's relevance for fans of the sport.</data>
