    <edge source="TRAVELLING" target="CHINESE FAMILY">
      <data key="d8">229.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Chinese family engages in travelling as a significant tradition that serves to strengthen their bonds and create shared experiences during holidays. This activity is not only a means of celebration but also a way to emphasize family unity and connection. The family's travels allow them to spend quality time together, exploring new places and creating lasting memories, which reflects their values and the importance they place on family. Through these shared experiences, the family's strong connection is highlighted, making travelling an integral part of their culture and holiday traditions. Overall, travelling is a cherished family activity that reinforces their familial ties and enhances their collective experiences.</data>
      <data key="d10">0c6340fc8bdb1d3193627e161c72755e,23962edee0e90a78b610d964d66194dc,26a2452eaca831965b72b56369fb1337,32cb71886d4e80661095a944499b4f09,342a21b0bf2f63daaf8c442a5ce6495a,35aa9653e1c6e4440967c151156e5f12,37b1a2f05ed8d4511f6322fddd258cff,3b11400a2d03121464513ac65c62d32c,40e2d27e0a06c6ce58e5e022b02f4dff,411e5ff777a38c7b9b190e88524a59d6,45cd2e9b77943bec372293340bf2ed3b,4a283c4dcaf86ef25b0d3f2e44e4067c,53265891695cc080b9ae59af8a7db9fd,5707992eb0d033ed33de4aebbe7fff8e,5b39be8f273be835efc59eb1807747c9,667fd5cb090a542bf735fdad4ed72700,668e89702ca3f7e5575a49296ac308ed,67128b26f7ddf9fcbd661692122bb2c9,6bdbb25a597fd863b94be69387f2eb82,78b4a059f4f161d2795f6c69a2982f50,7909499bff4220708d2e8f9df7f7862b,7d19eaa24453da153155434f70d8d1c7,9d4b3ad7885a842c497d8e6ab863b121,9e446227aa0a2e86f1edebcd6ad8ae77,a017de6c0abe4140620a3e1ffe3135a1,b0237f228f22156bdca4a217c14c2824,c14346b03f1765f27564d870ef067835,c797a91c69e5682f02062b2cc4ac98d1,d4cbd7d4cbdc616dbcb3a49cf0b61ff7,dd00af66238fd44a8dafa392a102b9d1,e248b15e2354e7afd1071d6e60c9e2a9,e6886c904da28efe92ab34f6aa835292,e9f1a5556e3046792ca864f0c6e584f6,ebcc7870dd2dbb354bcd10748d4e7146,f9398a0d13b29da9337ff3085379001b,fd1830a40858eaea69d24013a6c6f1d4,fe79f6283d972ef12913846a7a016ce8</data>
