    <edge source="TRAVELLING" target="DOUGHNUTS">
      <data key="d8">21.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The author has a rich tradition of baking doughnuts that is deeply intertwined with family celebrations and their experiences of travelling. This activity is not only a cherished part of their family gatherings but also often coincides with their travels, making it a significant aspect of their holiday traditions. Baking doughnuts serves as a way to celebrate special occasions, and these celebrations frequently take place during family trips, reinforcing the connection between the two activities. The author associates the act of baking doughnuts with the joy of spending time together as a family, whether at home or while travelling, highlighting the importance of both culinary and experiential traditions in their family life.</data>
      <data key="d10">26a2452eaca831965b72b56369fb1337,32cb71886d4e80661095a944499b4f09,35aa9653e1c6e4440967c151156e5f12,45cd2e9b77943bec372293340bf2ed3b,53265891695cc080b9ae59af8a7db9fd,5707992eb0d033ed33de4aebbe7fff8e,667fd5cb090a542bf735fdad4ed72700,6bdbb25a597fd863b94be69387f2eb82,78b4a059f4f161d2795f6c69a2982f50,a017de6c0abe4140620a3e1ffe3135a1,c797a91c69e5682f02062b2cc4ac98d1,d4cbd7d4cbdc616dbcb3a49cf0b61ff7,e248b15e2354e7afd1071d6e60c9e2a9,e6886c904da28efe92ab34f6aa835292,fd1830a40858eaea69d24013a6c6f1d4</data>
      <data key="d11">6fefb317687d4ac98efe39a52f3e190f</data>
