    </edge>
    <edge source="TRAVELLING" target="YUSUP MALANG">
      <data key="d8">3.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Yusup Malang has a strong interest in travelling, which is one of his hobbies that broadens his knowledge. This passion for travel, particularly overseas, plays a significant role in his family's activities and experiences, highlighting its importance in their lives.</data>
      <data key="d10">2507b8b7a634a73b80364a407e578482,b4f4bb403f6fdbb70b37a9dac19e9f44</data>
