    <edge source="TRAVELLING" target="FAMILY">
      <data key="d8">27.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The author's family places a strong emphasis on travelling together, considering it a significant aspect of their shared experiences. They frequently engage in travel during holidays, using these opportunities to create lasting memories and strengthen their bonds. Overall, travelling serves as a vital family activity that enhances their connections through the enjoyment of shared adventures.</data>
