      <data key="d8">1852.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup, located in Indonesia, played a significant role in the celebration of Indonesia's 79th Independence Day on August 17th, 2024. The school organized a massive event to commemorate this important national occasion, showcasing its national pride and involvement in the country's festivities. Through various activities and events, SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup highlighted the significance of Indonesia's Independence Day, marking the country's 79th birthday. This celebration is part of the school's annual agenda, reflecting its commitment to participating in national events and fostering a sense of patriotism among its students and the community.</data>
