      <data key="d8">478.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Flag Ceremony celebrated Indonesia's Independence Day, serving as a significant event that honors the country's national identity and independence. This ceremony was held to commemorate Indonesia's Independence, involving the entire school community, including students, teachers, and staff. It reflected national pride and unity, marking a crucial occasion in the celebration of Indonesia's independence. The event was characterized by a collective effort to honor Indonesia's Independence Day, emphasizing the importance of this national milestone in the hearts of the participants.</data>
