      <data key="d8">135.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Students in Indonesia celebrated their national pride and independence through various events, prominently featuring a flag ceremony. During this ceremony, they honored Indonesia's independence, demonstrating their patriotism and respect for their country. The students actively participated in the flag ceremony, which served as a significant occasion to express their commitment to honoring Indonesia's independence. Through these celebrations, they showcased their dedication to their national identity and values.</data>
