    <edge source="INDONESIA" target="INDONESIAN INDEPENDENCE DAY CELEBRATION">
      <data key="d8">427.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Indonesia celebrates its Independence Day on August 17, marking the anniversary of its independence. This significant event, known as the Indonesian Independence Day Celebration, is a national occasion that honors and commemorates the country's freedom. Throughout the celebration, Indonesia's independence is recognized and celebrated, highlighting the importance of this day in the nation's history. The event serves as a focal point for national pride and unity, as it brings together citizens to reflect on the significance of their independence. Overall, the Indonesian Independence Day Celebration is a vital event that underscores Indonesia's sovereignty and the spirit of its people.</data>
      <data key="d10">03191a0780989c3558807de4f35fe832,0ed2c8f80b3376c14b25a9c8f2a89b12,1bd601c5c18ef502a7f9751b152907d0,23478e6fc35cfbafcc509409fbde46dd,2409d7275358cd4b448f53c042aaa30b,277b77b9222aba87a4e47f4e583b09f2,2cc6d2871dd269aa38f13559146960f1,370219b79f8843d873312998af3a22af,3ba8c607cc0a2484fa665e8264d876d6,3e7c3ed333477611228bc441bd518109,41b46e4fcc77475a33c28c59376ea24d,45797c6b696156d74e87546be3825973,61d8ad79af66ab03e0fbb903ffba4a27,682d287c6eb9a0cf0a59063ae32cb315,722947bf8d62b63a078254a9759977d4,740c58068a89f59274aa003756c7ae58,805ab04367ddce41b25132bd4b4bf9c6,86082608a6d227d4a68387e43069d934,93c740b615063a399104512c6020c484,975403585897c6ecb66ac1521e23eda3,98ce812f375481d9e8406f362f1b928d,997c3d6f99807f9de8322acd1238cf1a,9fc78fe2e3c156fa6c1d9b1f11952c45,a22986115d24f22aab486ff574e89653,a588d2f20aa0cb53f58c7e00088ee290,a6fd4b4b72a02b95931c43bd62804509,b1dbf8134dfd0da6d818b3b3f7dc5f64,b93152509ecf3025072e39b062b9259f,c744831ccacc5cd27305dad7f3edc82d,cc288402ec09d69074907df03049696e,d3fb64aee2c56fe50586aa5643c50566,da58ad1aaba3b5bd50e0b3f27d439ab2,db24066b6104998a1029afd05dfc6e56,e2c0d0d01656c936f3542f9bba4bca57,ec76180b2043395ebdf9c4a2ee8cb497,ee9cb98ff94642af1908d0a170d30749,efc0aa2d7ce15b4a17f7aa9c5157ee3b,f57cd20f51630b97dce196550efb4eab,f83200680937d2b4f772ab7b21c301b7,f953cab028614f6d8129341817b95502,fe66dcee464ae0cfcf656c61380ec951,fe9fc5a2efc831c6164cdf1c735942e1</data>
