    <edge source="INDONESIA" target="INDEPENDENCE DAY">
      <data key="d8">47.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Independence Day is a national holiday in Indonesia, celebrated annually on August 17th. This significant day marks the country's independence and is a time for the nation to commemorate its freedom. The holiday is recognized as a national celebration, reflecting Indonesia's pride in its sovereignty and the historical importance of its independence.</data>
      <data key="d10">1d72f1c9fd5b80665b61f7b70e03d540,3326909c7d12deca65de1f2fc4372617,7ed28112092f149fd4997fcca2661eed,a4db3f612f67d050224cc2cb438dc5d1,b4b4f2c891d4fa45160af4c253b26e5e,b7f19838eb314a6c9059ffa22fa59559,ca16491e51d076ae8ad4d6a9b85af7a8,e6e1f4cfcb3ef9e99fab23bafe310543</data>
