      <data key="d12">295</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="INDONESIA" target="OSIS KOSAYU">
      <data key="d8">37.0</data>
      <data key="d9">OSIS Kosayu is a student organization in Indonesia that played an active role in the celebration of Indonesia's Independence Day. The organization organized various events, including games and competitions, to commemorate this significant national holiday. Through these activities, OSIS Kosayu contributed to the broader festivities surrounding Indonesia's Independence Day, engaging students and the community in the celebrations.</data>
      <data key="d10">0cdd1a23ecb37be6d2755d432e61fa47,31f495aa16e8d040f4b156d0ce5571cf,5f19feaa0396bff0bf4ec80ee067be37,6085be6b00302048cc91b63c2049197b,7e4cd1035510b151d7701716ff97c922,d8d5e8d7cb00e4b54e65599f411e755a,fdf6bb81467d53d7294eef19437354b9</data>
