    <edge source="INDONESIA" target="RENDANG">
      <data key="d8">46.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Rendang is a traditional dish from Indonesia that plays a significant role in the country's culinary heritage. It is celebrated during various cultural festivities, most notably during Indonesia's Independence Day. This dish not only highlights the rich flavors and cooking techniques of Indonesian cuisine but also serves as a representation of Indonesian culture. Rendang is often featured in cultural celebrations, symbolizing the pride and identity of the Indonesian people. Its importance in Indonesian cuisine is underscored by its frequent inclusion in festive occasions, making it a beloved and iconic dish within the nation's culinary landscape.</data>
      <data key="d10">0f7a523bd8755bf8634693fb3dd320f3,4815a06cdc09ca3358548e3718440632,5b38c5eb4e520c0d5eea80f7399d1952,653c9dff6d9827485379c29285cffd2b,679e6e0841249a033be46d6828241466,71c66d1162c593833341feacf2654272,7551e993488fdc857d1c274a25eb52e3,779a7e13f3e2d8da657d154c62f9f4ac,88385b7d8551f794ee971fa7947cbc28,89951530dd4ae45b39416fd7c5f34ad6,95d3e5f9cd0d0cace51de5b34381a152,95fee24ce44025a9905c679291e22123,a2904143c6ae9a3103951338656553de,a8c34603a2978bef2fd289b8b2fad873,a998f007ee91b6c9a774e51d72b82de6,b0f4db2e4aa9f9defc0dcd01ef3ba459,b98d98ba20f18a8f1dae7d2cad092ea9,be8874610f898116f141112c136e2a14,d82664356db37ad4160d576259a33df3</data>
      <data key="d11">b0966a0f455e44229e6c9705d57bfca9</data>
