    <edge source="INDONESIA" target="CULINARY BUSINESSES">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Culinary businesses in Indonesia play a crucial role in the coffee industry, utilizing local coffee beans to create a diverse range of coffee drinks and desserts. These businesses contribute significantly to the country's culinary landscape, showcasing the rich flavors and cultural significance of Indonesian coffee.</data>
