    <edge source="INDONESIA" target="INDONESIAN CUISINE">
      <data key="d8">4.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Indonesia is the country where Indonesian Cuisine originates, characterized by its diverse food culture and culinary practices. Indonesian Cuisine includes a wide array of dishes, with Rendang being one of its notable examples. The cultural significance of Indonesian Cuisine is highlighted in various contexts, such as during flag ceremonies that honor Indonesia, further emphasizing the connection between the nation and its rich culinary heritage.</data>
      <data key="d10">12510209ab32df54f135e7d2de82e7ae,28f9ec2a49d28ef8dbe2367673ec48ed,89951530dd4ae45b39416fd7c5f34ad6</data>
