    <edge source="INDONESIA" target="TEACHERS">
      <data key="d8">25.0</data>
      <data key="d9">In Indonesia, teachers play a significant role in the educational environment, actively participating in the flag ceremony to honor the country's independence. This participation reflects their commitment to instilling national pride and values among students. The teachers' involvement in the ceremony underscores their dedication to commemorating Indonesia's independence, as they support and engage in activities that celebrate this important national event. Through their actions, teachers contribute to fostering a sense of patriotism and respect for the nation's history within the educational setting.</data>
