    <edge source="COFFEE" target="COFFEE CHERRIES">
      <data key="d8">342.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Coffee is a beverage made from coffee cherries, which are harvested and processed to create coffee beans. The process involves collecting the cherries, which are the fruit of the coffee plant, and then transforming them into the beans that are ultimately brewed to produce coffee. This transformation can include various methods of processing, but the end result is the same: coffee is derived from these cherries, whether it is referred to as coffee beans or simply coffee. The descriptions consistently emphasize that coffee originates from coffee cherries, highlighting the essential role of these fruits in the production of the popular beverage.</data>
      <data key="d10">048269ae298e29136a527a89c01376b0,0d3e3e61d90a8bed3435a6540fa21b4c,13d9abba81dabab2e89912b329a9f60f,18aa5f53d5c15fdf3af8391842abee2e,1acbb397f1146749d1bfa0edd0a42d85,1ff4a40a7f2242cef2196d9d55713d5b,21ff0556160a2e1a97bf334864bfe48a,2645f9ab21364aa932142feca2c9d1e8,2eefc4addb9ebc67f89377ba591aafe0,356542fce3b8397d5446d0a5bc8ec08e,4609b58b90d9e40a897d599b608a7ad3,4839900ee624ba75c86230d9f423e116,4fb3c41f56fd66162b1c74503e385502,6357f12da8d5938caf30b3cdff8e463d,77606d20e1fa15ee358e3e58c8985b84,811b0eb836d0a3a17e2fca476fd0c3c7,89ac925dcc2d82af780dd8bebc5c3080,8b7fb3131130f63105150ae0a5f1f857,8d344a295b535b9bcb584606e38797c9,951d23310233db95fb2aad029b63c871,9d5e1f40c5490449d7f390851af81b72,a293a1339db2894414f622657795d2a5,a4773eb9274a1facd80d87439cd0c054,aa6fb60205a134977c5b3505452e2ab9,aadd1b6fa329903f44920f47f56ac541,b3b716c93c99eccad0936db11d4947af,c94746495699743307fe62f8944208bb,ceaf9283c39ab982f4c92afcdab6009f,d0ef13d5282d5331da5ac781d0b6925d,d15244c1f12560a6e73f864478457754,d6833e848bfc8d176402ca3b5f19f878,df1142ef01391002e59cd0ee0c586953,e6442abb66a00b575ae8c4e9a3ab856d,eb4e14fa60a2acdfa3843f16bd555b00,eb88fd11b76d2df23794f6b92e75b492</data>
