    <edge source="COFFEE" target="BAKER">
      <data key="d8">16.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The baker is deeply engaged in the art of creating baked goods, which are often complemented by coffee, highlighting a significant relationship between baking and coffee culture. This connection is particularly evident in Indonesia, where the baker is well-versed in coffee making, further intertwining the two culinary traditions. Additionally, the baker's enjoyment of homemade doughnuts underscores this relationship, as both baked goods and coffee are popular elements in culinary experiences, reinforcing the bond between the two entities.</data>
      <data key="d10">24687f2d2dd0a529b751d25443008b58,4c81830877edf04490f74342b608787b,615c41f77a8d5e9017f17b2c660ede8a,dfbd2e1adeb8ba7294271218feb33228</data>
      <data key="d11">1ba06fe2e86140a59bbc4f4e969d0f71</data>
      <data key="d12">317</data>
