    </edge>
    <edge source="COFFEE" target="RESTAURANTS">
      <data key="d8">311.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Coffee plays a significant role in the offerings of restaurants, particularly within the culinary industry. It is commonly served as part of restaurant menus, where it is utilized in various beverages and dishes. In Indonesia, restaurants often incorporate coffee into their menus, contributing to the rich coffee culture of the region. Many establishments source high-quality coffee beans from Indonesia, showcasing the importance of local coffee production in their culinary offerings.

Restaurants not only serve coffee as a standalone beverage but also use it as a key ingredient in a variety of drinks and desserts. This highlights coffee's integral role in enhancing the culinary experience for customers. By utilizing processed coffee beans, restaurants are able to create diverse menu items that reflect the significance of coffee in both Indonesian cuisine and the broader culinary industry. Overall, coffee is a vital component of restaurant menus, enriching the dining experience and supporting the coffee culture.</data>
      <data key="d10">0253f3eca3c9a192495431566eda2dfa,0d53ba4c17d87cbb6cddc011b7c280af,11b480126ee4cefd4b46538150d083c9,173b1ecbf2a744d097ae168edbaf17e1,17e89bec04a1876b8607739403e43ec1,220d09baa5089a943ac339a2340d2f7d,25996f4ebebf3106a557db852ca8c800,2874a340a4164d3a59c5eb2140a802a1,2c9e51ac63bb54781711b825480f82b1,2cc6639219b38939e6cfa3931f4b2dd8,453e3b14da5190213752d4a3c765713c,462d6a8b60a6a4ecff27cb32773f10d8,542b8405c327415ab4413b34b804cd65,57cd77081d35192f4344b6b9f4126d5b,5a0f4bf4dfc81c7b3c555f39ec5e42b7,6e3516d89d90313f31790d2376e1e840,704c28a5054b0e7f75df85d4eee62380,775f71c2030c26d2dd92cc8c9d4765d0,77682508a87255141a4e2fb6666e0c6d,78abc5585914d7787dbd78635275b970,82748d0f6a5eae1db4ece21d6134dceb,8b8e06d930721dfc278218ba4df82929,a78535a60b9725781bbe79bb3981d18e,b3a7b340444c8cc452a889f82f6c8be3,bddfd859689e0e612747bab511c58cbd,de34fb3f94fcc48d3c86048fa55fd08e,e433fe087f0fcf1087745b1d395b7650,eae22077f472221cde688a6379cf4359</data>
      <data key="d11">36caa0a230c8422c8acb4dc62e35bb32</data>
      <data key="d12">318</data>
