    </edge>
    <edge source="COFFEE" target="COFFEE SHOPS">
      <data key="d8">326.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Coffee and coffee shops are integral components of the coffee industry in Indonesia. Coffee shops serve and sell coffee, which is a major commodity in the country, and they play a crucial role in the local coffee culture. These establishments specialize in processing and serving various coffee drinks made from Indonesian coffee beans, showcasing the quality and flavor of the local product.

The coffee served in these shops highlights the rich coffee culture of Indonesia, emphasizing the popularity and high quality of Indonesian beans. Coffee shops utilize processed coffee beans sourced from Indonesia to create a diverse range of drinks and desserts, making coffee a central aspect of their business model. By focusing on coffee, these shops contribute significantly to the coffee consumption culture and are key players in the coffee market, directly related to both the coffee commodity and the production process. Overall, coffee shops are essential to the promotion and appreciation of Indonesian coffee, serving as a vital link between the product and consumers.</data>
      <data key="d10">0253f3eca3c9a192495431566eda2dfa,0d53ba4c17d87cbb6cddc011b7c280af,11b480126ee4cefd4b46538150d083c9,173b1ecbf2a744d097ae168edbaf17e1,17e89bec04a1876b8607739403e43ec1,220d09baa5089a943ac339a2340d2f7d,25996f4ebebf3106a557db852ca8c800,2874a340a4164d3a59c5eb2140a802a1,2c9e51ac63bb54781711b825480f82b1,2cc6639219b38939e6cfa3931f4b2dd8,453e3b14da5190213752d4a3c765713c,462d6a8b60a6a4ecff27cb32773f10d8,542b8405c327415ab4413b34b804cd65,57cd77081d35192f4344b6b9f4126d5b,5a0f4bf4dfc81c7b3c555f39ec5e42b7,6e3516d89d90313f31790d2376e1e840,704c28a5054b0e7f75df85d4eee62380,775f71c2030c26d2dd92cc8c9d4765d0,77682508a87255141a4e2fb6666e0c6d,78abc5585914d7787dbd78635275b970,82748d0f6a5eae1db4ece21d6134dceb,8b8e06d930721dfc278218ba4df82929,a78535a60b9725781bbe79bb3981d18e,b3a7b340444c8cc452a889f82f6c8be3,bddfd859689e0e612747bab511c58cbd,de34fb3f94fcc48d3c86048fa55fd08e,e433fe087f0fcf1087745b1d395b7650,eae22077f472221cde688a6379cf4359</data>
      <data key="d11">09940fed9d154504948bba2df1789a50</data>
      <data key="d12">319</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="COFFEE" target="CAFES">
      <data key="d8">302.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cafes play a crucial role in the coffee culture and industry in Indonesia, serving as dedicated establishments for coffee consumption. They primarily focus on offering a diverse range of coffee beverages made from high-quality Indonesian coffee beans, which enhances the overall coffee experience for customers. By preparing and serving various coffee drinks, cafes contribute significantly to the local culinary scene and economy, showcasing the unique flavors of Indonesian coffee.

In addition to coffee, many cafes also provide desserts that incorporate Indonesian coffee, further enriching the culinary offerings. The cafes not only serve coffee as a primary product but also engage in processing coffee beans for their beverages, linking them closely to the coffee industry. This specialization in coffee drinks makes cafes a vital part of the coffee consumption culture in Indonesia, emphasizing the social aspect of enjoying coffee in casual settings.

Overall, cafes are integral to the coffee experience in Indonesia, utilizing local coffee beans to create a variety of beverages and desserts, thereby enhancing the popularity and appreciation of coffee within the community.</data>
      <data key="d10">0253f3eca3c9a192495431566eda2dfa,0d53ba4c17d87cbb6cddc011b7c280af,11b480126ee4cefd4b46538150d083c9,173b1ecbf2a744d097ae168edbaf17e1,17e89bec04a1876b8607739403e43ec1,25996f4ebebf3106a557db852ca8c800,2874a340a4164d3a59c5eb2140a802a1,2c9e51ac63bb54781711b825480f82b1,2cc6639219b38939e6cfa3931f4b2dd8,453e3b14da5190213752d4a3c765713c,462d6a8b60a6a4ecff27cb32773f10d8,542b8405c327415ab4413b34b804cd65,57cd77081d35192f4344b6b9f4126d5b,5a0f4bf4dfc81c7b3c555f39ec5e42b7,704c28a5054b0e7f75df85d4eee62380,775f71c2030c26d2dd92cc8c9d4765d0,77682508a87255141a4e2fb6666e0c6d,78abc5585914d7787dbd78635275b970,82748d0f6a5eae1db4ece21d6134dceb,8b8e06d930721dfc278218ba4df82929,a78535a60b9725781bbe79bb3981d18e,b3a7b340444c8cc452a889f82f6c8be3,bddfd859689e0e612747bab511c58cbd,de34fb3f94fcc48d3c86048fa55fd08e,e433fe087f0fcf1087745b1d395b7650,eae22077f472221cde688a6379cf4359</data>
      <data key="d11">4d6608557eed49368a6d09c7c5c664c5</data>
      <data key="d12">320</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="COFFEE" target="HOTELS">
      <data key="d8">46.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Hotels play a significant role in enhancing the guest experience by incorporating coffee into their dining services. They often feature locally sourced Indonesian coffee, showcasing the rich coffee production of the region. Guests can enjoy a variety of coffee options, whether in dining areas or through room service, as hotels integrate coffee into their hospitality offerings. This not only enhances the overall experience but also allows guests to appreciate the unique flavors of Indonesian coffee. By providing coffee services, hotels aim to elevate their hospitality, ensuring that guests have access to quality local coffee during their stay.</data>
      <data key="d10">0253f3eca3c9a192495431566eda2dfa,0d53ba4c17d87cbb6cddc011b7c280af,11b480126ee4cefd4b46538150d083c9,173b1ecbf2a744d097ae168edbaf17e1,17e89bec04a1876b8607739403e43ec1,220d09baa5089a943ac339a2340d2f7d,25996f4ebebf3106a557db852ca8c800,2874a340a4164d3a59c5eb2140a802a1,2c9e51ac63bb54781711b825480f82b1,2cc6639219b38939e6cfa3931f4b2dd8,453e3b14da5190213752d4a3c765713c,462d6a8b60a6a4ecff27cb32773f10d8,542b8405c327415ab4413b34b804cd65,57cd77081d35192f4344b6b9f4126d5b,5a0f4bf4dfc81c7b3c555f39ec5e42b7,6e3516d89d90313f31790d2376e1e840,704c28a5054b0e7f75df85d4eee62380,775f71c2030c26d2dd92cc8c9d4765d0,77682508a87255141a4e2fb6666e0c6d,78abc5585914d7787dbd78635275b970,82748d0f6a5eae1db4ece21d6134dceb,8b8e06d930721dfc278218ba4df82929,a78535a60b9725781bbe79bb3981d18e,b3a7b340444c8cc452a889f82f6c8be3,bddfd859689e0e612747bab511c58cbd,de34fb3f94fcc48d3c86048fa55fd08e,e433fe087f0fcf1087745b1d395b7650,eae22077f472221cde688a6379cf4359</data>
      <data key="d11">eb7c93eeb9dc41aab57d29e97ebb4951</data>
      <data key="d12">321</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="COFFEE" target="COFFEE BEANS">
      <data key="d8">136.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Coffee and coffee beans are intricately linked in the coffee-making process, where coffee beans serve as the final product ready for commercial use. Coffee is a commodity that encompasses both the production and processing of coffee beans, which are derived from coffee cherries. The transformation of coffee cherries into coffee beans involves several steps, including roasting and milling. Ultimately, coffee is produced from these processed coffee beans, which are essential for the coffee industry and are crucial for brewing coffee. Thus, coffee represents the end product made from the careful processing of coffee beans, highlighting the importance of both the beans and the cherries in the overall coffee-making process.</data>
      <data key="d10">13d9abba81dabab2e89912b329a9f60f,18aa5f53d5c15fdf3af8391842abee2e,1acbb397f1146749d1bfa0edd0a42d85,1ff4a40a7f2242cef2196d9d55713d5b,21ff0556160a2e1a97bf334864bfe48a,2645f9ab21364aa932142feca2c9d1e8,2eefc4addb9ebc67f89377ba591aafe0,356542fce3b8397d5446d0a5bc8ec08e,4fb3c41f56fd66162b1c74503e385502,6357f12da8d5938caf30b3cdff8e463d,77606d20e1fa15ee358e3e58c8985b84,811b0eb836d0a3a17e2fca476fd0c3c7,89ac925dcc2d82af780dd8bebc5c3080,8b7fb3131130f63105150ae0a5f1f857,951d23310233db95fb2aad029b63c871,a293a1339db2894414f622657795d2a5,a4773eb9274a1facd80d87439cd0c054,aa6fb60205a134977c5b3505452e2ab9,aadd1b6fa329903f44920f47f56ac541,b3b716c93c99eccad0936db11d4947af,c94746495699743307fe62f8944208bb,ceaf9283c39ab982f4c92afcdab6009f,d0ef13d5282d5331da5ac781d0b6925d,d6833e848bfc8d176402ca3b5f19f878,e6442abb66a00b575ae8c4e9a3ab856d,eb4e14fa60a2acdfa3843f16bd555b00,eb88fd11b76d2df23794f6b92e75b492</data>
      <data key="d11">3b6e2ac584b64847b53828c9d779fed3</data>
      <data key="d12">322</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="COFFEE" target="CULINARY BUSINESSES">
      <data key="d8">23.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Coffee plays a significant role in culinary businesses, where it is supplied in the form of coffee beans for a variety of applications. These businesses transform coffee into an array of drinks and desserts, showcasing the versatility of coffee in the culinary world. The relationship between coffee production and culinary applications is evident, as culinary businesses utilize both raw and processed coffee beans for various commercial purposes, including grinding, packaging, and incorporating coffee into their food and beverage offerings. This direct connection highlights the importance of coffee in enhancing the products and services provided by culinary businesses.</data>
      <data key="d10">0d3e3e61d90a8bed3435a6540fa21b4c,4609b58b90d9e40a897d599b608a7ad3,8d344a295b535b9bcb584606e38797c9,9d5e1f40c5490449d7f390851af81b72,a8f94ba67b8d620aa91f96bd63ef99bb,c163b156071057950c938c0b74dd62df,d15244c1f12560a6e73f864478457754</data>
