    <edge source="COFFEE" target="CAFE">
      <data key="d8">21.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cafes are establishments that serve a variety of coffee drinks, making coffee a key component of their offerings. They play an important role in the coffee consumption culture, providing a space for people to enjoy different coffee beverages while socializing or relaxing.</data>
      <data key="d10">220d09baa5089a943ac339a2340d2f7d,6e3516d89d90313f31790d2376e1e840</data>
