    <edge source="COFFEE CHERRIES" target="RAW COFFEE BEANS">
      <data key="d8">22.0</data>
      <data key="d9">COFFEE CHERRIES are the fruit from which RAW COFFEE BEANS are derived. After processing, the coffee cherries yield raw coffee beans, which are the seeds found inside the cherries. This process is essential for transforming the cherries into the beans that are ultimately used for brewing coffee.</data>
      <data key="d10">048269ae298e29136a527a89c01376b0,4839900ee624ba75c86230d9f423e116,df1142ef01391002e59cd0ee0c586953</data>
      <data key="d11">b7cd9a62710849778fdadced0d754687</data>
      <data key="d12">326</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="COFFEE CHERRIES" target="COFFEE BEANS">
      <data key="d8">158.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Coffee cherries are the initial fruit harvested from coffee plants, and they undergo several processing steps to become coffee beans. The transformation of coffee cherries into coffee beans involves various methods, primarily roasting and milling. After harvesting, the cherries are processed to extract the beans, which are then roasted to enhance their flavor and prepare them for consumption. This comprehensive process ensures that coffee cherries are effectively converted into the coffee beans that are enjoyed worldwide.</data>
      <data key="d10">0d3e3e61d90a8bed3435a6540fa21b4c,13d9abba81dabab2e89912b329a9f60f,18aa5f53d5c15fdf3af8391842abee2e,1acbb397f1146749d1bfa0edd0a42d85,1ff4a40a7f2242cef2196d9d55713d5b,21ff0556160a2e1a97bf334864bfe48a,2645f9ab21364aa932142feca2c9d1e8,2eefc4addb9ebc67f89377ba591aafe0,4fb3c41f56fd66162b1c74503e385502,6357f12da8d5938caf30b3cdff8e463d,77606d20e1fa15ee358e3e58c8985b84,811b0eb836d0a3a17e2fca476fd0c3c7,89ac925dcc2d82af780dd8bebc5c3080,8b7fb3131130f63105150ae0a5f1f857,951d23310233db95fb2aad029b63c871,a293a1339db2894414f622657795d2a5,a4773eb9274a1facd80d87439cd0c054,aadd1b6fa329903f44920f47f56ac541,ab28db58e2038f0ddc57e4f7f77fbaaa,b3b716c93c99eccad0936db11d4947af,c94746495699743307fe62f8944208bb,ceaf9283c39ab982f4c92afcdab6009f,d0ef13d5282d5331da5ac781d0b6925d,d6833e848bfc8d176402ca3b5f19f878,e6442abb66a00b575ae8c4e9a3ab856d</data>
      <data key="d11">432a6b4962544200949421a96a405142</data>
      <data key="d12">327</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="COFFEE CHERRIES" target="CULINARY BUSINESSES">
      <data key="d8">2.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Coffee cherries are the initial raw material used in coffee production, and culinary businesses may engage with them during the early stages of this process. These businesses rely on coffee cherries to create various coffee products, highlighting the integral role that coffee cherries play in the culinary industry.</data>
      <data key="d10">356542fce3b8397d5446d0a5bc8ec08e,eb4e14fa60a2acdfa3843f16bd555b00</data>
      <data key="d11">d6700b360ac141d282cdb567414bf4ce</data>
      <data key="d12">328</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="RAW COFFEE BEANS" target="ROASTING PROCESS">
      <data key="d8">9.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Raw coffee beans undergo a roasting process that is essential for developing their flavor, aroma, and color. This transformation is crucial in preparing the beans for brewing, as the roasting process enhances the overall sensory qualities of the coffee.</data>
      <data key="d10">048269ae298e29136a527a89c01376b0,4839900ee624ba75c86230d9f423e116,df1142ef01391002e59cd0ee0c586953</data>
      <data key="d11">c1b40a4039b44061a358e098867f7412</data>
      <data key="d12">329</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ROASTING PROCESS" target="MILLING PROCESS">
      <data key="d8">1.0</data>
      <data key="d9">After roasting, coffee beans are milled to prepare them for brewing.</data>
      <data key="d10">048269ae298e29136a527a89c01376b0</data>
      <data key="d11">4643a7a319674adfb732b6f6122c7c64</data>
      <data key="d12">330</data>
      <data key="d13">0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SMAK KOLESE SANTO YUSUP" target="OSIS KOSAYU">
      <data key="d8">2035.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup is an educational institution that hosts OSIS Kosayu, a student organization dedicated to enhancing student engagement through various events and activities. OSIS Kosayu plays a significant role within the school, particularly in organizing and facilitating events for the student body. 

One of the notable collaborations between SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup and OSIS Kosayu was for the Independence Day celebrations. During this event, OSIS Kosayu organized a variety of games and competitions, contributing to the overall festivities. The organization was responsible for planning and executing the activities associated with the Independence Day celebration, ensuring that students had an engaging and enjoyable experience.

In summary, OSIS Kosayu operates within SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup, where it organizes events, including the Independence Day celebration, thereby fostering a vibrant school community through student-led initiatives.</data>
