    <edge source="SMAK KOLESE SANTO YUSUP" target="FASHION SHOW">
      <data key="d8">620.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup hosted a Fashion Show as a significant event during its Independence Day celebration. This event was organized as part of the festivities commemorating Indonesia's Independence Day, also referred to as the 17an celebration. The Fashion Show played a central role in the celebrations, showcasing the school's commitment to cultural expression and community engagement during this important national holiday.</data>
