      <data key="d8">120.0</data>
      <data key="d9">SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup organized a fashion show during the Independence Day celebration, with Rendang as the central theme for the costume design project. This theme was chosen to showcase Indonesian cuisine and culture, highlighting the significance of Rendang, a traditional dish. The event included a costume design competition where students created costumes inspired by Rendang, demonstrating their creativity and connection to Indonesian heritage. The fashion show, organized by students, featured various interpretations of the Rendang theme, celebrating both the culinary and cultural aspects of Indonesia during this important national holiday.</data>
