      <data key="d8">407.0</data>
      <data key="d9">OSIS Kosayu played a pivotal role in organizing the Fashion Show as part of the Indonesian Independence Day celebration, commonly referred to as the 17an celebration. This event was a significant component of the festivities, showcasing the creativity and talent of the students involved. OSIS Kosayu was responsible for not only facilitating the Fashion Show but also for coordinating various games and competitions that were part of the broader Independence Day activities. The Fashion Show was themed and served as a highlight among the events organized by OSIS Kosayu, emphasizing their commitment to celebrating national pride and cultural expression during this important occasion. Overall, the Fashion Show was an integral part of the Independence Day celebrations, reflecting the efforts and involvement of OSIS Kosayu in making the event memorable.</data>
