      <data key="d8">785.0</data>
      <data key="d9">OSIS Kosayu played a pivotal role in the Indonesian Independence Day Celebration at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup by organizing and facilitating a variety of activities. They were responsible for holding games and competitions designed to enhance participation, excitement, and the overall atmosphere of the event. Throughout the celebration, OSIS Kosayu organized these activities to foster engagement among students and to contribute to the festive spirit of the occasion. Their efforts were integral to the success of the Independence Day Celebration, showcasing their commitment to promoting school spirit and community involvement.</data>
