      <data key="d8">164.0</data>
      <data key="d9">OSIS Kosayu organized a series of games and competitions as part of the Independence Day celebration. These events took place at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup, where OSIS Kosayu aimed to foster a spirit of community and patriotism. The organization was involved in planning and executing various activities to commemorate Independence Day, ensuring that the celebrations were engaging and enjoyable for all participants. Through these efforts, OSIS Kosayu successfully contributed to the festive atmosphere surrounding the Independence Day event at the school.</data>
