    <edge source="OSIS KOSAYU" target="AUGUST 17TH 2024">
      <data key="d8">18.0</data>
      <data key="d9">OSIS Kosayu organized a series of games and competitions in celebration of Independence Day on August 17th, 2024. The events were designed to engage the community and foster a spirit of unity and patriotism among participants.</data>
      <data key="d10">40aad91a62ec25631a62ce1e4493eab0,7463ac53d8bf715a191dd33a26727d6e,d21eb25b6d4f0d34922c352dce50ea0a</data>
