    <edge source="FASHION SHOW" target="RENDANG">
      <data key="d8">1375.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Fashion Show prominently featured Rendang as its central theme, showcasing the cultural significance of this traditional Indonesian dish. Rendang served as the primary inspiration for the costume designs created by students, influencing both the aesthetic and conceptual elements of the event. The fashion show celebrated Indonesian cuisine, with Rendang highlighted as a key dish, reflecting its importance in the culinary culture of Indonesia.

Throughout the event, various costumes were designed around the theme of Rendang, emphasizing its cultural relevance and showcasing the rich heritage of Indonesian culinary traditions. The Fashion Show included a costume design competition, particularly during the Independence Day celebration, where Rendang was the focal point for the designs presented. This thematic choice not only highlighted the dish itself but also aimed to educate attendees about its significance within Indonesian cuisine.

Overall, the Fashion Show effectively combined artistic expression with cultural education, using Rendang as a vehicle to celebrate and promote Indonesian culinary culture. The event was marked by a variety of costumes inspired by Rendang, each reflecting its cultural importance and the creativity of the designers involved.</data>
