    <edge source="FASHION SHOW" target="INDONESIAN INDEPENDENCE DAY CELEBRATION">
      <data key="d8">230.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Fashion Show is a significant event that takes place during the Indonesian Independence Day Celebration, highlighting student creativity and cultural themes. It serves as a platform for students to showcase their themed designs and artistic expressions. This event is an integral part of the activities held during the celebration, particularly noted at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup, where it has been recognized as a key feature of the festivities. The Fashion Show not only emphasizes creativity but also reflects the cultural heritage associated with Indonesia's independence, making it a vibrant and essential component of the overall celebration.</data>
      <data key="d10">069059043e47a468c3f1d4ded0dce31e,207c9bf6d566900d095ab5d71f4da5e9,23478e6fc35cfbafcc509409fbde46dd,25023b9d6eebaab47cb08f8cebc544f0,277b77b9222aba87a4e47f4e583b09f2,3e9eb64d5193a0bb9c05003fb2b2eec8,4279c5a93be6d8654d203f8fbefffb34,45797c6b696156d74e87546be3825973,47011991c1658e9feab31a070aaeb2dc,722947bf8d62b63a078254a9759977d4,7771ee60258896b5720900992a98a387,8e50875777a13191641837bd63ee731e,975403585897c6ecb66ac1521e23eda3,997c3d6f99807f9de8322acd1238cf1a,a22986115d24f22aab486ff574e89653,a588d2f20aa0cb53f58c7e00088ee290,b27832219742ab1597c8d763cf57e031,c0340350cb4b5de43d16482a265a8c61,d0f94135be0e2deefea95f423f9453de,d73fed53ff546d00dc1b485d69d1b04c,d75c2658825b2784eec6b68bdfd3f6b5,efdb6ed7431980357694252cc850e33b,f44632fe0ea356517002a8b0bf5bf04f,fe9fc5a2efc831c6164cdf1c735942e1</data>
