    <edge source="FASHION SHOW" target="STUDENTS">
      <data key="d8">315.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Fashion Show involved students who participated in various capacities, including as designers, models, and supporters. During the event, which took place during the Independence Day celebrations, students showcased their creativity and talent through their designs. Many students contributed to the design and execution of costumes, with a particular focus on themes inspired by Indonesian Cuisine, notably featuring designs based on Rendang. The students' involvement was crucial to the success of the Fashion Show, as they took on multiple roles and responsibilities, ensuring a vibrant and creative presentation. Overall, the students' participation highlighted their artistic abilities and commitment to the event, making it a memorable occasion.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bc65b38d62fffeb5682724d960c8700,0f1a44748c878143b677345ebf156e3e,0f962a8aa6bec77883242c5204796a32,0fd934d3e2b3b6088374d0feffd8217e,12cb4fd83f59fe74a6b72cc7ce224104,133c3bee64c1597b10a246cb94fdc711,197406b7b5e629de843fb521a2929765,210d56189237484bceecd976284cd1eb,2b8d117db7fef2447c0edbb1e9ac9124,3326909c7d12deca65de1f2fc4372617,3aea96f21552eb00a6fb9126d682a973,3bf8fc7d99d6f99a259ea052e75fb136,5b87ba5f7766a00f4b6653a957771163,7447b5a0990afaa41fbb55c70a92649c,77b410d543f58747f304622f54d7e485,7990bfd88125d6a67970e4b817a0d68e,a1b718066b0e79b13af5ac431be6b13b,afabfec482129115e569ec321f9c945d,c57df0c90bdd4e9a839dc92cc96f10e0,d73fed53ff546d00dc1b485d69d1b04c,d75c2658825b2784eec6b68bdfd3f6b5,db979be172c6b5f6acc734d93ffcef12,dfc94e99d21a3e39d27f2ec605524deb,e1ee9832c6ce1dae5f9ebb38e8b515bb,e7b46f329b9a3a4932f3f5480349fcc1,f52a53a804698e666d10d2f09b8671da</data>
