    <edge source="FASHION SHOW" target="TEACHERS">
      <data key="d8">156.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Fashion Show received significant appreciation from the teachers, who recognized the students' creativity, efforts, and designs. Throughout the event, teachers expressed their admiration for the students' costumes and the hard work they put into their presentations. They provided constructive feedback and encouragement, highlighting the students' creativity and the quality of their designs. The overall sentiment from the teachers was one of support and appreciation, as they acknowledged the students' dedication and the impressive outcomes of their efforts in the Fashion Show.</data>
