    <edge source="FASHION SHOW" target="INDONESIAN CUISINE">
      <data key="d8">165.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Fashion Show was centered around the theme of Indonesian Cuisine, which significantly influenced the designs and showcased various cultural elements associated with this rich culinary tradition. The event highlighted the cultural significance of Indonesian food, particularly focusing on traditional dishes such as Rendang. Through costume design, the Fashion Show presented a vibrant array of designs inspired by Indonesian Cuisine, emphasizing not only the aesthetic appeal but also the cultural aspects of the featured dishes. Overall, the Fashion Show served as a celebration of Indonesian Cuisine, integrating its flavors and traditions into the realm of fashion.</data>
