      <data key="d8">80.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Fashion Show is a significant component of the 17an event, which celebrates student creativity and participation. It showcases various cultural themes and highlights the talents of students. This event is an integral part of the celebrations for the 17an, taking place at SMAK Kolese Santo Yusup. Throughout the 17an celebrations, the Fashion Show serves as a platform for students to express their creativity, making it a key highlight of the festivities.</data>
