    <edge source="RENDANG" target="INDONESIAN CUISINE">
      <data key="d8">163.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Rendang is a prominent and celebrated dish within Indonesian Cuisine, recognized for its rich flavor and cultural significance. It serves as a key representation of Indonesian culinary heritage and has inspired various creative projects, including a costume project and a fashion show. The theme of the costume project was centered around Indonesian Cuisine, with Rendang being the specific dish that inspired the designs. Similarly, the fashion show featured Rendang as a central element, showcasing costumes that highlighted this significant dish. Overall, Rendang not only exemplifies the culinary traditions of Indonesia but also plays a vital role in cultural events that celebrate Indonesian Cuisine.</data>
