    <edge source="RENDANG" target="INDONESIAN INDEPENDENCE DAY CELEBRATION">
      <data key="d8">34.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Rendang played a significant role in the Indonesian Independence Day Celebration, serving as a prominent theme for various activities. It was featured as a central element in a fashion show that highlighted Indonesian cuisine, showcasing the rich culinary heritage of the nation. The fashion show, themed around Rendang, not only celebrated this iconic dish but also included costume designs inspired by it, further emphasizing its cultural importance. Additionally, Rendang was recognized as a highlight of Indonesian cuisine during the celebration, reinforcing its status as a beloved national dish. Overall, Rendang was integral to the festivities, both as a culinary highlight and as a thematic inspiration for the fashion and costume design projects associated with the Indonesian Independence Day Celebration.</data>
