    <edge source="FLAG CEREMONY" target="STUDENTS">
      <data key="d8">338.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The FLAG CEREMONY is an important event organized by the school to honor and celebrate Indonesia's Independence. During this ceremony, STUDENTS actively participate as flag bearers, demonstrating their commitment, teamwork, and involvement in national celebrations. Their participation not only reflects their dedication to the event but also showcases their role in honoring Indonesia's independence. The students' engagement in the flag ceremony highlights their contribution to school activities and their connection to national pride, as they come together to commemorate this significant occasion. Overall, the students' involvement in the FLAG CEREMONY exemplifies their respect for their country's history and their active role in school traditions.</data>
      <data key="d10">0bd5cd57a4c728798fe84357b9d3bc1f,0fd934d3e2b3b6088374d0feffd8217e,133c3bee64c1597b10a246cb94fdc711,1fc0f667540ded153065389b2ff02fed,2265c1fef143a4ff686a0365450634c0,28acc61ea721188ba7d0248df6c1c6bb,31fcc83610260d5cbe445fb4e6442126,361a99abe9ba5b02b7e22fdf2d2c8e6c,3d3fa30026f147fae6e4199717e22c9d,42eb76afc88c3a91aeee4f194f2b4458,5314163c424df79e7c31c670221b229c,6111385dcb1ac8b3b91653baf1146abb,679e6e0841249a033be46d6828241466,72ce1099a3ac33be669483fa6061fbd9,76c7bc45256648795bd309bb31945c9b,781e8c2addfc0f439b3c7cfe8a763de1,7990bfd88125d6a67970e4b817a0d68e,7abfccbd7d46003a8ccffad1520ef750,7f9e5d048ca91c76408994ac6ae687d2,86dae4a7725894005dfa64de6343b75f,8b8ae71a06c5ff7d186bcde202035082,a1b718066b0e79b13af5ac431be6b13b,adf324e3226f6c5755c6dcc6c8bc88fe,ba2bba262e9c1e4133777917c75704be,bad6864065b7db339635eb094e4c7748,c4dd622774946512e1467438e438c8bf,e1ee9832c6ce1dae5f9ebb38e8b515bb,e7b46f329b9a3a4932f3f5480349fcc1,ebf804c2b3e89f31aaeb73067990b442,f3a6aa9869d3294cc4a90632c59ebae2,f49201eb3c70adafb517a4ca27a458e7</data>
