    <edge source="FLAG CEREMONY" target="TEACHERS">
      <data key="d8">245.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The FLAG CEREMONY is a significant event organized by the school to celebrate Indonesia's Independence. During this ceremony, TEACHERS play a crucial role by guiding and supporting students throughout the celebration. They are actively involved in the organization and execution of the event, ensuring that it is both educational and patriotic. Teachers oversee the proceedings, helping students engage meaningfully in the ceremony, which honors Indonesia's independence. Their participation not only contributes to the success of the event but also fosters a sense of national pride among the students. Through their involvement, teachers help create a supportive environment that encourages student participation and honors the significance of Independence Day.</data>
      <data key="d10">0fd934d3e2b3b6088374d0feffd8217e,1fc0f667540ded153065389b2ff02fed,2265c1fef143a4ff686a0365450634c0,31fcc83610260d5cbe445fb4e6442126,361a99abe9ba5b02b7e22fdf2d2c8e6c,3d3fa30026f147fae6e4199717e22c9d,42eb76afc88c3a91aeee4f194f2b4458,5314163c424df79e7c31c670221b229c,6111385dcb1ac8b3b91653baf1146abb,679e6e0841249a033be46d6828241466,72ce1099a3ac33be669483fa6061fbd9,76c7bc45256648795bd309bb31945c9b,781e8c2addfc0f439b3c7cfe8a763de1,7abfccbd7d46003a8ccffad1520ef750,7f9e5d048ca91c76408994ac6ae687d2,86dae4a7725894005dfa64de6343b75f,8b8ae71a06c5ff7d186bcde202035082,adf324e3226f6c5755c6dcc6c8bc88fe,ba2bba262e9c1e4133777917c75704be,bad6864065b7db339635eb094e4c7748,c4dd622774946512e1467438e438c8bf,ebf804c2b3e89f31aaeb73067990b442,f49201eb3c70adafb517a4ca27a458e7</data>
