    <edge source="FLAG CEREMONY" target="STAFF">
      <data key="d8">149.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The FLAG CEREMONY is a significant event organized to honor Indonesia's independence, and the STAFF play a crucial role in its execution. Staff members assist in organizing and executing the ceremony, ensuring that it runs smoothly and successfully. They work collaboratively with students and teachers, participating actively in the celebration of Independence Day. Their involvement includes both organizing the event and taking part in the ceremony itself, demonstrating their commitment to supporting the school's efforts in commemorating this important occasion. Through their contributions, the staff help create a meaningful experience for all participants, reinforcing the significance of Indonesia's independence.</data>
      <data key="d10">1fc0f667540ded153065389b2ff02fed,2265c1fef143a4ff686a0365450634c0,31fcc83610260d5cbe445fb4e6442126,3d3fa30026f147fae6e4199717e22c9d,42eb76afc88c3a91aeee4f194f2b4458,5314163c424df79e7c31c670221b229c,6111385dcb1ac8b3b91653baf1146abb,679e6e0841249a033be46d6828241466,72ce1099a3ac33be669483fa6061fbd9,781e8c2addfc0f439b3c7cfe8a763de1,8b8ae71a06c5ff7d186bcde202035082,adf324e3226f6c5755c6dcc6c8bc88fe,c4dd622774946512e1467438e438c8bf,ebf804c2b3e89f31aaeb73067990b442,f49201eb3c70adafb517a4ca27a458e7</data>
