    <edge source="FLAG CEREMONY" target="SCHOOL">
      <data key="d8">239.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The FLAG CEREMONY was an event organized by the SCHOOL to honor and celebrate Indonesia's Independence. This significant occasion involved the entire school community, including all students and staff, and was held to commemorate Indonesia's Independence Day. The school arranged the flag ceremony with the intention of fostering a sense of national pride and unity among its members, emphasizing the importance of this national holiday. Throughout the event, the school community came together to pay tribute to Indonesia's independence, reflecting a collective commitment to honoring their nation's history and values.</data>
