      <data key="d8">25.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Indonesian Independence Day Celebration saw active participation from students, who engaged in a variety of activities and performances. Throughout the event, students took on various roles, contributing to the overall festivities. Their involvement included a range of activities designed to commemorate the significance of Indonesian independence, showcasing their enthusiasm and commitment to honoring this important national occasion.</data>
