    <edge source="INDONESIAN INDEPENDENCE DAY CELEBRATION" target="AUGUST 17, 2024">
      <data key="d8">19.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Indonesian Independence Day Celebration is held annually on August 17, marking the anniversary of Indonesia's independence. In 2024, this significant event will take place on August 17, 2024, continuing the tradition of commemorating the nation's freedom and sovereignty.</data>
