    <edge source="SCHOOL" target="CREME">
      <data key="d8">316.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Creme is conveniently located by the school's parking lot, making it an accessible and popular spot for students. It serves as a go-to place for students after school hours, providing snacks and refreshments to those who frequent the area. The proximity to the school allows Creme to cater specifically to students attending the school and those involved in after-school activities. Overall, Creme is a well-frequented establishment that meets the needs of students looking for a quick snack or a place to relax after their school day.</data>
