    <edge source="SCHOOL" target="CONGEE">
      <data key="d8">202.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Congee is a beloved comfort food among students at school, often enjoyed after long academic days. It serves as a source of warmth and solace, particularly during stressful times. Many students consume congee after school activities, reflecting its significance in their daily routines. The dish is not only popular for its comforting qualities but is also frequently sought after by students looking for a satisfying meal after a busy day. Various stalls near the school offer congee, making it easily accessible for students seeking comfort food. The author also shares a personal connection to congee, indicating its relevance to their own school life and culinary preferences. Overall, congee is a favored dish that resonates with students, symbolizing comfort and familiarity in the school environment.</data>
