    <edge source="SCHOOL" target="LATTE">
      <data key="d8">119.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Latte is a popular beverage among students at the school, frequently enjoyed during study sessions and academic activities. It serves as a comforting drink that students often consume while engaging in their studies, whether at school or after school while working on assignments. The author also enjoys lattes while studying, linking the beverage to their academic lifestyle and the school environment. This connection highlights the role of latte as a common choice for students, especially after a long day of school activities, making it a favored drink that enhances their study experience. Overall, latte is not only a beverage of choice for students but also a significant part of their academic routine, reflecting its importance in the school setting.</data>
