      <data key="d9">The SCHOOL and the CAFE are closely connected, with the cafe serving as a popular destination for students from the school. Located conveniently near the school, the cafe offers a variety of snacks and beverages, making it an ideal spot for students to visit after classes and during after-school activities. Its proximity to the school enhances its appeal, as students frequently stop by to grab refreshments, contributing to its popularity among the student body.</data>
