      <data key="d8">124.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Cookies are a widely enjoyed snack among students at school, often serving as a delightful treat after a long day or following school activities. Among the various options available, cookies from Creme stand out as a particularly popular choice. Students frequently indulge in these cookies after school, appreciating their taste and convenience. Overall, cookies, especially those from Creme, are a favored snack for students, enhancing their school experience and providing a sweet reward after their daily routines.</data>
