    <edge source="SCHOOL" target="INDONESIAN CUISINE">
      <data key="d8">44.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The SCHOOL organized a fashion show themed around INDONESIAN CUISINE, where students participated in creating costumes that showcased their creativity. This event allowed students to explore and celebrate their culinary heritage, further emphasizing the cultural significance of Indonesian cuisine. Through this project, the school provided a platform for students to engage with and express their appreciation for Indonesian culinary traditions.</data>
      <data key="d10">11d2fbbcb307a708107645f2d451d94c,3aa7e1c76ebe4651b1b924ba46d3514e,7bb4f7f7baed6d37e26ddfb31940ecb8,b6555c3fdf905339f7cc1e835bb486c7,b95a86944f9618d8c4e580c6c01a9832</data>
