    <edge source="SCHOOL" target="TEACHERS">
      <data key="d8">216.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The SCHOOL is an educational institution where TEACHERS play a vital role in guiding and supporting students during various events. TEACHERS are actively involved in organizing and participating in significant ceremonies, such as the flag ceremony and the celebration of Indonesia's independence. They not only participate in these events but also take on responsibilities in organizing them, ensuring that the ceremonies honor the country's heritage and engage the students meaningfully.

During the flag ceremony, TEACHERS contribute by evaluating student projects and appreciating their efforts, fostering a sense of community and pride among the students. Their involvement extends to providing support during all school events, highlighting their commitment to enhancing the educational experience and recognizing the achievements of the students. Overall, TEACHERS are integral to the SCHOOL's mission, playing a crucial role in both the organization and execution of events that celebrate national pride and student accomplishments.</data>
