    <edge source="DEPOT SANTO YUSUP" target="CENTURY EGG">
      <data key="d8">278.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Depot Santo Yusup is known for its congee, which prominently features century egg as a key ingredient. This ingredient is not only a popular topping but also highlights the significance of the dish within their menu offerings. The presence of century egg in the congee showcases its importance and popularity among customers, making it a favored choice at Depot Santo Yusup. The establishment serves congee with century egg, emphasizing a culinary relationship that enhances their menu and appeals to patrons seeking authentic flavors. Overall, century egg plays a vital role in defining the culinary experience at Depot Santo Yusup.</data>
