    <edge source="DEPOT SANTO YUSUP" target="YOUTIAO">
      <data key="d8">149.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Depot Santo Yusup is known for its culinary offerings, particularly the pairing of youtiao with congee. Youtiao, a traditional fried dough stick, is commonly served as a side dish alongside congee at this establishment, enhancing the overall dining experience. This combination is not only popular but also indicates a strong food pairing relationship, as youtiao complements the congee well. The inclusion of youtiao as part of the meal at Depot Santo Yusup highlights its role as a traditional accompaniment, making it a favored choice among patrons seeking to enjoy a complete and satisfying meal.</data>
