      <data key="d9">Depot Santo Yusup and Brokenside Cafe are both popular food establishments that operate in the same industry, specifically within the culinary space. They cater to a similar customer base, primarily serving the local community and students in the area near the school. Both establishments are known for providing comfort food options, enhancing the local dining scene and contributing to the dining culture of the neighborhood. They are frequented by customers looking for satisfying meals and beverages, indicating a thematic relationship between the two. Overall, Depot Santo Yusup and Brokenside Cafe are integral parts of the local dining landscape, appealing to a shared clientele and offering a variety of comfort food choices.</data>
