    <edge source="BAKING" target="DOUGHNUTS">
      <data key="d8">31.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Baking doughnuts is a specific activity within the broader context of baking, emphasizing the author's signature recipe. This process not only showcases the author's culinary skills but also serves as a means of creating doughnuts that are integral to family celebrations. The relationship between baking and doughnuts is direct, as the act of baking is essential for producing these beloved treats, which hold special significance in the author's family traditions.</data>
      <data key="d10">9d5f5a7df15d0e102fcc7c5c750d7ce7,b697c1b68cd58b6d7d3db2081f471fc4,c0476ba3696dd8b6abb55d9e8e56c2c1</data>
