    <edge source="BAKING" target="KITCHEN">
      <data key="d8">15.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Baking is an activity that occurs in the kitchen, a central location for culinary activities where creativity and passion are expressed. The kitchen serves as the heart of baking, facilitating the preparation and creation of various baked goods.</data>
      <data key="d10">0e9cb8fc1021c7d5795ddb037576f43d,685c798022960e9200d4044e62179ea0</data>
