    <edge source="BAKING" target="TRAVELING">
      <data key="d8">2.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Baking and traveling are interconnected activities that can significantly influence one another. Traveling exposes individuals to diverse cultures, which in turn can inspire new baking recipes and techniques. The experiences gained while traveling allow bakers to incorporate unique elements from various culinary traditions, leading to innovative and culturally rich baked goods. Thus, the art of baking is often enhanced by the insights and flavors discovered through the journey of traveling.</data>
      <data key="d10">0e9cb8fc1021c7d5795ddb037576f43d,685c798022960e9200d4044e62179ea0</data>
      <data key="d11">667ee58a79194316ae2b82eadd3fc575</data>
