    <edge source="CHINESE FAMILY" target="FAMILY TRIP">
      <data key="d8">158.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The Chinese family places a strong emphasis on family trips, which are a significant tradition in their lives. These trips serve as a vital means for the family to bond, celebrate achievements, and create lasting memories together. Engaging in family trips during holidays allows them to reinforce their familial ties and enjoy shared experiences, reflecting their values of togetherness and exploration.

The family's tradition of traveling together is particularly meaningful, as it often occurs after successful academic years, providing an opportunity to celebrate accomplishments while strengthening their connections. Through these journeys, the Chinese family not only explores new places but also cherishes the time spent together, highlighting the importance of togetherness in their family life. Overall, family trips are a cherished practice that showcases the family's commitment to nurturing their relationships and celebrating their shared experiences.</data>
      <data key="d10">05e24b43fdc7a81f5525f90db81260a8,354e17446aefa055d4a3861588dc7558,3de52c6928566893f87d83ce2e81c21a,523c6232a21d8d940288c4f27d411a2b,58d5651c3abdb74e3f0cf92b2dd0dde3,5f180ab9541ddc075bbb64cdbe37b1a2,809305e103324f18b85bbfb7433dfda1,83d5cb28ae8b3c28d721421eb5d29cfd,87d8923b3d9520a851d9745d430ad43c,8abe6231b542f8ee9438e2b0de97e988,8eaaf074b3dee3e8c486c0f22e7e0f80,91d8af1ef4354a1eb8b414791a795e0d,a0c3b82463936aecdeee6bb09890c1e8,a56679eec8d12ef6e22807f2673fbe97,aaf3a0a17c8a81e405d4bf5d0a52b8c3,adff67638e3e9f5ae49981dcdf993411,b0138efccb36f40e6865c6798d69f90b,b25e57265d365bf725ecc29df3e63fbd,b917a8c7d3a8d70548c8a7421a013d3f,c34e1566e0cf16930e809db5f045f198,d52a6954b8b06a8270e7bea4939bad54,e20d0b841012aeecda27abf81debca24,ebb14d045c691755fdd9ffc8206d3cbc</data>
