    <edge source="KITCHEN" target="RACING DRIVER">
      <data key="d8">26.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The kitchen serves as a significant space in the life of a racing driver, where they can indulge in their personal interests outside of the high-speed world of racing. It is a place where they may prepare meals, reflecting their personal life and showcasing their passion for cooking and baking. This space highlights a side of the racing driver that goes beyond the sport, allowing them to express their love for hospitality and culinary arts. Overall, the kitchen represents an important aspect of the racing driver's identity, blending their professional life with their personal passions.</data>
