    <edge source="KITCHEN" target="F1">
      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The kitchen is a cherished space for the individual, where they find joy in cooking and baking, activities that serve as a delightful contrast to the high-stakes world of F1 racing. This space not only allows them to indulge in their culinary hobbies but also serves as a venue for preparing food while enjoying F1 races, thereby intertwining their passion for both cooking and the excitement of high-speed sports. The speaker admires F1 racing and actively follows the sport, highlighting a dual enthusiasm for both the culinary arts and the thrill of racing.</data>
