      <data key="d8">11.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The kitchen serves as a vital space for culinary creativity, where individuals can prepare food that enhances their travel experiences. It is a place where meals can be inspired by diverse cultures encountered during trips, allowing for a rich exploration of global cuisines. Additionally, the experiences gained from traveling can be brought back to the kitchen, further enriching the cooking process and enabling the preparation of dishes that reflect the flavors and traditions of various destinations. Overall, the kitchen and trips are interconnected, as each influences and enhances the other through the joy of culinary exploration.</data>
