    <edge source="JAPAN" target="F1">
      <data key="d8">151.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Japan is recognized as a significant location for Formula 1 (F1) events, which are hosted in the country and contribute to its reputation within the global motorsport community. These events not only enhance Japan's standing as a destination for motorsport enthusiasts but also highlight the country's active participation in international racing. F1 races held in Japan attract a diverse audience of racing fans and drivers, showcasing the nation's rich motorsport culture. The presence of F1 events in Japan underscores its relevance in the global motorsport scene, making it an appealing location for both local and international racing aficionados. Overall, Japan's involvement in F1 events reinforces its importance in the world of motorsport.</data>
      <data key="d10">00e7fbd02db76e04aac3f14df2938c0b,049727acae0a3dd5f0c25c8c943503b2,0560a2b6f36fe5371f9d5d0040f55bac,196106171d0d0739d352f99d420f567a,27e3e04aa83e1763c40817072b921cde,2ec7d63899a3ecb2b00767931c3820a7,413a653ab3c6c005289cbdf97b112dcf,446105997513572d47dae7044739a381,4a32ae42d1eab968162c98e8877b0bd7,5c0d8b3eb5a5267f79a4c21ccfa3e9ee,5eeb1d55307c73aa9c3383ff4fe1ff90,66915383c732cee9bb7aaa5f8cced91c,7348b4211baead4a72d8675e96427bfe,751e45a4747d536a53c1e2009c12f9f7,7dc646481faa972baf95f49a4ea82878,91411deda29a7489e5e6d8caa54be0b5,99338880997e0ccfd2a54207ae38bfd3,a789e979c00cbbce05692a60bbb0fd72,a9327b3766696194ff58c9c80d106c88,b97d629166db6bae6665118f359f3f6b,bdf98cb7e8c901884625c9608462ed0a,cf2822216396b4ba7bbbce58e3d8c471,e153d7011ace5d9ce0109c83199d0b6a,e60bdc753ad2145d9e73114b1a1c9a3c,ea56dac49f0afed84e1978b71de20e0f</data>
