    <edge source="SOUTH KOREA" target="F1">
      <data key="d8">39.0</data>
      <data key="d9">South Korea has a notable connection to Formula 1 (F1), having hosted several events that highlight the country's enthusiasm for motorsport. These F1 events have not only showcased South Korea's interest in racing but have also enhanced its profile within the global motorsport community. The presence of F1 in South Korea appeals to local racing enthusiasts and attracts fans and participants from the region, making it a significant location for motorsport events.

The possibility of future F1 events in South Korea indicates the country's ongoing engagement in international motorsport and its commitment to contributing to the local motorsport scene. Hosting F1 events adds excitement to the racing calendar and reinforces South Korea's relevance as a destination for motorsport fans. Overall, South Korea's involvement with F1 reflects its dedication to connecting with the global racing community and fostering a vibrant motorsport culture.</data>
