    <edge source="FAMILY" target="COUNTRY">
      <data key="d8">131.0</data>
      <data key="d9">The FAMILY engages in travel together, embarking on trips to various COUNTRIES during holidays. This shared experience allows them to explore new cultures, cuisines, and adventures, creating lasting memories. The author's family particularly emphasizes the joy of discovering different countries together, highlighting the strong relationship between family and travel. Through their journeys, they not only enjoy the beauty of diverse landscapes but also deepen their bonds by experiencing new cultures and experiences collectively. Overall, the family's travels serve as a testament to the importance of shared adventures and the enriching experiences that come from exploring the world together.</data>
