      <data key="d8">25.0</data>
      <data key="d9">Streaming apps play a significant role in connecting fans with F1 races, allowing them to watch events from the comfort of their homes. The author utilizes these streaming apps to view F1 races, highlighting a direct relationship between their interest in the sport and the technology used for viewing. This connection underscores how streaming platforms facilitate access to F1, bridging the gap between the event and its audience. Overall, the use of streaming apps enhances the experience of following F1, demonstrating the integration of technology in modern sports consumption.</data>
